Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.78,0:00:30.06,ENG,1,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:38.05,ENG,2,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.37,ENG,3,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:49.04,ENG,4,0,0,0,,a king and queen had a beautiful daughter named Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:51.91,ENG,5,0,0,0,,But she was possessed by a terrible curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:56.71,ENG,6,0,0,0,,By day, a lovely princess. By night, a hideous ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.64,ENG,7,0,0,0,,Only true love's kiss could lift her curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:03.97,ENG,8,0,0,0,,So Fiona waited in a tower, guarded by a dragon, until the day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.85,ENG,9,0,0,0,,when her true love would arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.34,ENG,10,0,0,0,,But as the days turned into years,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:13.47,ENG,11,0,0,0,,the King and Queen were forced to resort to more desperate measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.11,ENG,12,0,0,0,,Whoa, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.20,ENG,13,0,0,0,,I don't know about this, Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:14.70,ENG,14,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother said only true love's kiss could break Fiona's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:19.17,ENG,15,0,0,0,,I don't trust that woman, Harold. This may be our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.46,ENG,16,0,0,0,,Besides, he does come highly recommended by King Midas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:27.26,ENG,17,0,0,0,,But to put our daughter's life in the hands of this... person?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:32.14,ENG,18,0,0,0,,He's devious. He's deceitful. He's, he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.68,ENG,19,0,0,0,,Rumpelstiltskin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.53,0:02:40.07,ENG,20,0,0,0,,Mrs. Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.11,ENG,21,0,0,0,,How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.78,ENG,22,0,0,0,,Down, Fifi. Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:50.29,ENG,23,0,0,0,,As you can see, everything's in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:54.16,ENG,24,0,0,0,,So you'll put an end to our daughter's curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:58.66,ENG,25,0,0,0,,And, in return, you sign the kingdom of Far Far Away over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.88,ENG,26,0,0,0,,- Lillian, this is madness! - What choice do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.59,ENG,27,0,0,0,,Fiona has been locked away in that tower far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.84,ENG,28,0,0,0,,It's not like she's getting any younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:17.69,ENG,29,0,0,0,,But to sign over our entire kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:20.77,ENG,30,0,0,0,,Well, if your kingdom's worth more to you than your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:24.56,ENG,31,0,0,0,,Nothing is worth more to us than our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.57,ENG,32,0,0,0,,Jump, Fifi, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:39.58,ENG,33,0,0,0,,Just sign it and all your problems will disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:52.60,ENG,34,0,0,0,,Your Highness! The Princess! She's been saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.10,ENG,35,0,0,0,,Who saved her?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:02.81,ENG,36,0,0,0,,No one would have guessed that an ogre named Shrek,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:04.89,ENG,37,0,0,0,,whose roar was feared throughout the land,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.74,ENG,38,0,0,0,,would save the beautiful Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.86,ENG,39,0,0,0,,True love's kiss led to marriage and ogre babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.15,ENG,40,0,0,0,,The kingdom of Far Far Away was finally at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:18.71,ENG,41,0,0,0,,Goody for them! And they lived happily ever after!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:23.08,ENG,42,0,0,0,,Sir? You're gonna have to pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.00,ENG,43,0,0,0,,Maybe we could make a deal for it, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.88,ENG,44,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm not a real boy. - Do you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:37.80,ENG,45,0,0,0,,Nobody needs your deals anymore, Grumpel Stinkypants!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:47.32,ENG,46,0,0,0,,I wish that ogre was never born!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:01.58,ENG,47,0,0,0,,Wake up, Daddy, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.50,ENG,48,0,0,0,,- Good morning. - Good morning to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.17,ENG,49,0,0,0,,Better out than in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.08,ENG,50,0,0,0,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:15.22,ENG,51,0,0,0,,Did my little Fergus make a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.64,ENG,52,0,0,0,,...big, grownup ogre stink?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:22.01,ENG,53,0,0,0,,Oh, that's diabolical!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:27.35,ENG,54,0,0,0,,And on your left, the lovable lug that showed us you don't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:29.90,ENG,55,0,0,0,,change your undies to change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.24,ENG,56,0,0,0,,I wonder what Shrek's up to in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:36.69,ENG,57,0,0,0,,Get in there. Get... Impossible to put on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:40.99,ENG,58,0,0,0,,OK, the dragon goes under the bridge, through the loop...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:43.54,ENG,59,0,0,0,,...and finally, into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:50.25,ENG,60,0,0,0,,Play date!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.30,ENG,61,0,0,0,,∮ Regardless of spring, summer, autumn, winter. You just need to call me out ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.43,ENG,62,0,0,0,,Then Shrek kissed the Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.64,ENG,63,0,0,0,,She turned into a beautiful ogre and they lived...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:02.84,ENG,64,0,0,0,,Happily...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.48,ENG,65,0,0,0,,- Ever... - After.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:12.43,ENG,66,0,0,0,,Look! A shooting star!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.65,ENG,67,0,0,0,,So, what did you wish for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:18.90,ENG,68,0,0,0,,That every day could be like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.54,ENG,69,0,0,0,,Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:34.87,ENG,70,0,0,0,,Morning, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:36.17,ENG,71,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.59,ENG,72,0,0,0,,Better out than in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:42.59,ENG,73,0,0,0,,Did my little Fergus make a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.98,ENG,74,0,0,0,,Cute. Real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:50.94,ENG,75,0,0,0,,This lovable lug taught us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:54.03,ENG,76,0,0,0,,you don't have to change your undies to change the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.19,ENG,77,0,0,0,,Play date!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.32,ENG,78,0,0,0,,Shrek! The outhouse is clogged up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.45,ENG,79,0,0,0,,She turned into a beautiful ogre and they lived...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:05.65,ENG,80,0,0,0,,- Happily... - Ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:06.86,ENG,81,0,0,0,,After?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.79,ENG,82,0,0,0,,- Daddy, get up! - Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.79,ENG,83,0,0,0,,- Better out than in. - This lovable lug...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:19.14,ENG,84,0,0,0,,- Play date! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.22,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Outhouse again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.47,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.56,ENG,87,0,0,0,,Undies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.48,ENG,88,0,0,0,,Outhouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.77,ENG,89,0,0,0,,- Get up, get up! - And they lived...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.40,ENG,90,0,0,0,,- Happily... - Ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:36.81,ENG,91,0,0,0,,After.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:19.73,ENG,92,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.87,ENG,93,0,0,0,,Roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:19.58,ENG,94,0,0,0,,Nice landing, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:22.13,ENG,95,0,0,0,,Hey! Now remember, don't eat the valet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:27.22,ENG,96,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, ninos! Vamos a la fiesta!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:30.18,ENG,97,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrek, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.97,ENG,98,0,0,0,,Mr. Shrek, would you sign our pitchforks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.23,ENG,99,0,0,0,,And our torches?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.10,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Oh, man, you used to be so fierce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.10,ENG,101,0,0,0,,Yeah, when you were a real ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:41.19,ENG,102,0,0,0,,A real ogre?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.67,ENG,103,0,0,0,,Shrek, it's a sing-along. You've got to sing along!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.95,ENG,104,0,0,0,,- No, thanks. - Please? I'll be your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:03.59,ENG,105,0,0,0,,Why does being your best friend entail me doing everything I don't want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.08,ENG,106,0,0,0,,Please, Felicia, not in Daddy's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.51,ENG,107,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:09.84,ENG,108,0,0,0,,Could you do that ogre roar of yours for my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.51,ENG,109,0,0,0,,He's a big, big fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.80,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Do the roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.76,ENG,111,0,0,0,,You know, I'd rather not. It's my kids' birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.93,ENG,112,0,0,0,,- Do the roar. - Honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:19.43,ENG,113,0,0,0,,Why don't you go check on the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:22.98,ENG,114,0,0,0,,- Sure. - And don't forget the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:24.18,ENG,115,0,0,0,,Hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:26.32,ENG,116,0,0,0,,Thanks for the pants, Muffin Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:29.36,ENG,117,0,0,0,,I always wanted chaps! Yee-haw! Giddy up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.91,ENG,118,0,0,0,,- Monsieur Shrek. - Howdy, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.74,ENG,119,0,0,0,,Your cake. Voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:37.24,ENG,120,0,0,0,,- What is that supposed to be? - That's Sprinkles the Ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.79,ENG,121,0,0,0,,Isn't he cute? He looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.20,ENG,122,0,0,0,,But happy. It's a party, Shrek. You gotta cheer up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.96,ENG,123,0,0,0,,I'm in a great mood, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:47.00,ENG,124,0,0,0,,- Oh, I'm gonna lick me a rainbow! - Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.34,ENG,125,0,0,0,,As long as you're not doing anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:49.97,ENG,126,0,0,0,,how about one of those famous Shrek roars?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:52.68,ENG,127,0,0,0,,- Do the roar. - Let me set you straight, Butter Pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:55.39,ENG,128,0,0,0,,An ogre only roars when he's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:57.64,ENG,129,0,0,0,,You don't want to see me angry, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:59.09,ENG,130,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.40,ENG,131,0,0,0,,Hold it together. Just hold it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.64,ENG,132,0,0,0,,Daddy, he's getting away. Do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.10,ENG,133,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.78,ENG,134,0,0,0,,- What happened to the cake? - Trust me. It's an improvement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.53,ENG,135,0,0,0,,- You licked it! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.57,ENG,136,0,0,0,,Just because you're an ogre, doesn't mean you have to eat like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.03,ENG,137,0,0,0,,Looks like you forgot the candles!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.45,ENG,138,0,0,0,,OK, just watch the cake. I'll go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.91,ENG,139,0,0,0,,Watch the cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.70,ENG,140,0,0,0,,- Where's the cake?! - We ate the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:24.96,ENG,141,0,0,0,,- Ya. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:26.38,ENG,142,0,0,0,,No, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:29.04,ENG,143,0,0,0,,Hey! I believe you promised my son a roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.63,ENG,144,0,0,0,,- Do the roar. - Roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.09,ENG,145,0,0,0,,- I don't like it. - Pigs, we need another cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.10,ENG,146,0,0,0,,- We ate the other cakes. - One roar, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.67,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody! Shrek's gonna do his famous ogre roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:41.56,ENG,148,0,0,0,,Not now, Donkey. Pigs, are there any cupcakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:43.60,ENG,149,0,0,0,,- We ate them, too. - They have lollipops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:44.94,ENG,150,0,0,0,,No, I ate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:47.81,ENG,151,0,0,0,,- You didn't share? - Well, you didn't share the croissants!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.99,ENG,152,0,0,0,,- Everything's gonna be OK. - Shrek, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.11,ENG,153,0,0,0,,- Come on, Shrek, your fans are waiting! - Do the roar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.57,ENG,154,0,0,0,,We need the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:00.24,ENG,155,0,0,0,,Cake! Cake! Cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.39,ENG,156,0,0,0,,I love you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.26,ENG,157,0,0,0,,Everybody, I have found another cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.64,ENG,158,0,0,0,,Shrek? Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:53.59,ENG,159,0,0,0,,- Unbelievable. - Tell me about it! Those villagers...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:57.09,ENG,160,0,0,0,,I'm not talking about the villagers, Shrek. I'm talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.26,ENG,161,0,0,0,,Is this really how you want to remember the kids' first birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:04.43,ENG,162,0,0,0,,- Oh, great. So this is all my fault? - Yes. But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.64,ENG,163,0,0,0,,Let's talk about this after the party, at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:09.52,ENG,164,0,0,0,,You mean that roadside attraction we live in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:14.19,ENG,165,0,0,0,,Step right up! See the dancing ogre! Don't worry! He won't bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.53,ENG,166,0,0,0,,I used to be an ogre. Now I'm just a jolly green joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:23.00,ENG,167,0,0,0,,OK, OK, maybe you're not the ogre you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:24.87,ENG,168,0,0,0,,But maybe that's not such a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:28.71,ENG,169,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect you to understand. It's not like you're a real ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:31.17,ENG,170,0,0,0,,You spent half your life in a palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.88,ENG,171,0,0,0,,And the other half locked away in a tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:39.34,ENG,172,0,0,0,,Look, all I want is for things to go back to the way they used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:44.26,ENG,173,0,0,0,,Back when villagers were afraid of me, and I could take a mud bath in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.02,ENG,174,0,0,0,,When I could do what I wanted, when I wanted to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:51.56,ENG,175,0,0,0,,Back when the world made sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:54.40,ENG,176,0,0,0,,You mean back before you rescued me from the Dragon's Keep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:55.95,ENG,177,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:06.03,ENG,178,0,0,0,,Shrek, you have three beautiful children,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:08.37,ENG,179,0,0,0,,a wife who loves you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:12.59,ENG,180,0,0,0,,friends who adore you. You have everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:19.43,ENG,181,0,0,0,,Why is it the only person who can't see that is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.90,ENG,182,0,0,0,,That's just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:52.50,ENG,183,0,0,0,,If she thinks I'm gonna slink back there and apologize,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.75,ENG,184,0,0,0,,she's got another thing coming. She's not the boss of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:59.75,ENG,185,0,0,0,,I'm an ogre and I'm not gonna apologize for acting like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:04.26,ENG,186,0,0,0,,Help, please! Someone, anyone at all, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:06.18,ENG,187,0,0,0,,Please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.22,ENG,188,0,0,0,,Please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.39,ENG,189,0,0,0,,I'm stuck! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.39,ENG,190,0,0,0,,Oh, please, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:15.35,ENG,191,0,0,0,,Someone, anyone! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:19.03,ENG,192,0,0,0,,The pain! I can see a bright light. A tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:21.65,ENG,193,0,0,0,,Grandma? Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.20,ENG,194,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's me, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:26.95,ENG,195,0,0,0,,An ogre! Please, Mr. Ogre, please don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.66,ENG,196,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:32.12,ENG,197,0,0,0,,But you are an ogre... Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:35.13,ENG,198,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I... I used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.70,ENG,199,0,0,0,,Look, move out or get crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.87,ENG,200,0,0,0,,So you're not gonna eat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:44.88,ENG,201,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I already had a big bowl of curly-toed weirdo for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:49.22,ENG,202,0,0,0,,Wait up! What's your rush? Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:50.42,ENG,203,0,0,0,,Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.27,ENG,204,0,0,0,,What a coincidence! I was just heading that way myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:57.94,ENG,205,0,0,0,,But, seriously, let me give you a ride. I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:02.49,ENG,206,0,0,0,,Come on. It's the least I can do after all you've done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.57,ENG,207,0,0,0,,I got a hot rat cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:11.20,ENG,208,0,0,0,,All right! Can I interest you in a mudslide? Slug and tonic?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:14.33,ENG,209,0,0,0,,A liquid libation to ease that frustration?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:18.79,ENG,210,0,0,0,,- Eyeball-tini? - Well, maybe just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:23.71,ENG,211,0,0,0,,So the centaur says, "That's not the half I'm talking about."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:27.47,ENG,212,0,0,0,,I gotta say, Shrek, I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:30.97,ENG,213,0,0,0,,To live the life of an ogre... no worries, no responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.89,ENG,214,0,0,0,,You are free to pillage and terrorize as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:37.35,ENG,215,0,0,0,,- Free? That's a laugh. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:43.10,ENG,216,0,0,0,,Sometimes I wish I had just one day to feel like a real ogre again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:44.39,ENG,217,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.74,ENG,218,0,0,0,,Magical transactions are my specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:51.61,ENG,219,0,0,0,,Great. Next to mimes, magicians are my favourite people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:54.07,ENG,220,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:57.42,ENG,221,0,0,0,,"King for a Month." "Knight for a Week."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.79,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Ogre for a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:06.47,ENG,223,0,0,0,,Think about it, Shrek. To be feared and hated.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:07.67,ENG,224,0,0,0,,You'll be, like, "Roar!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:11.43,ENG,225,0,0,0,,And the villagers will be, like, "Get away! It's Shrek! I'm so scared of him!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:14.97,ENG,226,0,0,0,,It would be just like the good old days, when your swamp was your castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:20.77,ENG,227,0,0,0,,- When the world made sense. - All right, what's the catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:24.61,ENG,228,0,0,0,,Catch? No. There's no catch. No catchings, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.86,ENG,229,0,0,0,,I mean, there's something. Small thing. Nothing. A little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:30.03,ENG,230,0,0,0,,All right, I knew it. So what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.03,ENG,231,0,0,0,,- A day. - A day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.23,ENG,232,0,0,0,,Rat's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.96,ENG,233,0,0,0,,To make the magic work, you gotta give something to get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:41.04,ENG,234,0,0,0,,In this case, you gotta give a day to get a day. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:43.92,ENG,235,0,0,0,,I can't just pick up and leave my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:47.76,ENG,236,0,0,0,,But that's the best part, Shrek! It's a magical contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.75,ENG,237,0,0,0,,No one will even know you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:55.72,ENG,238,0,0,0,,And by the time this day is up, you are gonna feel like a changed ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.68,ENG,239,0,0,0,,Still, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:02.39,ENG,240,0,0,0,,Hey, no problem. Forget it, no big D. Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:05.06,ENG,241,0,0,0,,Do you like white meat or dark meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.32,ENG,242,0,0,0,,So what day would I have to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:12.36,ENG,243,0,0,0,,I don't know, any day. A day from your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.94,ENG,244,0,0,0,,A day you had the flu? A day you lost a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.53,ENG,245,0,0,0,,A day some meddling oaf stuck his nose where it didn't belong
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.33,ENG,246,0,0,0,,destroying your business and ruining your life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.46,ENG,247,0,0,0,,Just for an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.37,ENG,248,0,0,0,,How about the day I met Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:29.04,ENG,249,0,0,0,,Now, there's a day I'd like to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:31.22,ENG,250,0,0,0,,I don't know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.63,ENG,251,0,0,0,,I know. What about a day you wouldn't even remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:37.01,ENG,252,0,0,0,,Like a day when you were a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:42.43,ENG,253,0,0,0,,- An innocent, mindless little baby. - Take any of those days you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:46.98,ENG,254,0,0,0,,- Take them all for all I care. - Oh, just one will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:51.03,ENG,255,0,0,0,,OK, good. A day from your childhood it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:54.82,ENG,256,0,0,0,,I guess there's nothing wrong with wanting a little time for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.54,ENG,257,0,0,0,,Just 24 tiny little hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.78,ENG,258,0,0,0,,- I'm still my own ogre! - Yeah, you is!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.20,ENG,259,0,0,0,,I never needed to ask for anyone's permission before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.04,ENG,260,0,0,0,,So why start now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.18,ENG,261,0,0,0,,Go on, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:15.89,ENG,262,0,0,0,,Sign it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:18.43,ENG,263,0,0,0,,Go on, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.10,ENG,264,0,0,0,,Sign it, Shrek! Sign it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.09,ENG,265,0,0,0,,You signed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.06,ENG,266,0,0,0,,So, tell me. What happens now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.89,ENG,267,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.29,ENG,268,0,0,0,,I think I fell on my keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.74,ENG,269,0,0,0,,There are 40 children in that shoe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:53.75,ENG,270,0,0,0,,which is why the weasel goes pop to this very day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:54.96,ENG,271,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.63,ENG,272,0,0,0,,As we head over the river and through the woods...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:19:58.84,ENG,273,0,0,0,,Ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:23.82,ENG,274,0,0,0,,Kill the ogre! Kill the ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.46,ENG,275,0,0,0,,This is the part where you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.53,ENG,276,0,0,0,,Sure is great to be wanted again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:47.37,ENG,277,0,0,0,,Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:57.42,ENG,278,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:09.10,ENG,279,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.73,ENG,280,0,0,0,,My home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:27.41,ENG,281,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:32.42,ENG,282,0,0,0,,Fiona! Are you in there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:12.28,ENG,283,0,0,0,,All right, Rumpel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:15.45,ENG,284,0,0,0,,This wasn't part of the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.29,ENG,285,0,0,0,,Rumpel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.69,0:23:43.73,ENG,286,0,0,0,,Ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:48.16,ENG,287,0,0,0,,We've got another one, ladies! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:51.36,ENG,288,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:53.53,ENG,289,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my swamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:02.00,ENG,290,0,0,0,,Looks like a troublemaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.84,ENG,291,0,0,0,,Spread 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:20.19,ENG,292,0,0,0,,Nice job, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:32.03,ENG,293,0,0,0,,You witches are making a big mistake! I know my rights!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:34.82,ENG,294,0,0,0,,You have the right to shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.39,0:24:57.89,ENG,295,0,0,0,,Donkey, stop with the singing, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.06,ENG,296,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:11.90,ENG,297,0,0,0,,Donkey, where am I? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:15.24,ENG,298,0,0,0,,Quiet down there! Oh, I hate this song.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:24.75,ENG,299,0,0,0,,I'm driving, so I'm in charge of the music.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:28.76,ENG,300,0,0,0,,Will you witches make up your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:41.14,ENG,301,0,0,0,,Donkey? What's going on? Do you know where Fiona is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:44.48,ENG,302,0,0,0,,Quiet, ogre! You're gonna get me in trouble and I need this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:46.31,ENG,303,0,0,0,,I am not going back to work for Old MacDonald.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:49.27,ENG,304,0,0,0,,Tell me to E-l-E-l-O. "E-l-E-l-No!" That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.45,0:25:53.15,ENG,305,0,0,0,,Where are my babies? And where's your wife, Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.32,0:25:56.16,ENG,306,0,0,0,,Look, I think you have me confused with some other talking donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:57.70,ENG,307,0,0,0,,I've never seen you before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.87,0:26:00.44,ENG,308,0,0,0,,Never seen me before? Come on, Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:02.78,ENG,309,0,0,0,,And how do you know my name anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:05.83,ENG,310,0,0,0,,It's me, Shrek. Your best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:07.91,ENG,311,0,0,0,,A donkey and an ogre friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:10.33,ENG,312,0,0,0,,That's the most ridiculous thing I ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:15.67,ENG,313,0,0,0,,Can you at least tell me where they're taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:19.01,ENG,314,0,0,0,,To the same place they take every ogre. To Rumpelstiltskin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:22.89,ENG,315,0,0,0,,- Stiltskin! - I said quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:33.02,ENG,316,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:47.00,ENG,317,0,0,0,,It's time to crumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:51.50,ENG,318,0,0,0,,Place your bets! Place your bets! We start tout de suite!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.67,0:26:52.71,ENG,319,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.85,0:26:57.22,ENG,320,0,0,0,,Gingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:03.01,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Gingy snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:06.64,ENG,322,0,0,0,,There's one!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.81,0:27:08.52,ENG,323,0,0,0,,Disgusting, filthy ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:10.44,ENG,324,0,0,0,,Hideous monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.61,0:27:12.23,ENG,325,0,0,0,,Filthy, filthy creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.40,0:27:14.69,ENG,326,0,0,0,,Disgusting creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.47,ENG,327,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.57,0:28:02.33,ENG,328,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Donkey. I'll get us our lives back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.49,0:28:05.66,ENG,329,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. Put a little mustard on mine, Captain Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.78,0:28:44.61,ENG,330,0,0,0,,Mr. Stiltskin?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:48.79,ENG,331,0,0,0,,You got another customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:51.66,ENG,332,0,0,0,,- Wolfie! - Yes, Mr. Stiltskin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.66,ENG,333,0,0,0,,Bring me my business wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:56.04,ENG,334,0,0,0,,Mr. Stiltskin, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.97,0:29:01.42,ENG,335,0,0,0,,- OK, go. - Please make me a real boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:04.96,ENG,336,0,0,0,,Go away! Terms are in the details, balsa boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.14,0:29:07.89,ENG,337,0,0,0,,Sayonara, termites! Hello, acne!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:09.80,ENG,338,0,0,0,,Stiltskin!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:12.27,ENG,339,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.23,0:29:15.69,ENG,340,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.69,0:29:18.10,ENG,341,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.86,0:29:21.81,ENG,342,0,0,0,,Have I been waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:28.74,ENG,343,0,0,0,,Ladies, this is the guy that made all of this possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.83,0:29:32.37,ENG,344,0,0,0,,So, tell me, how are you enjoying your day?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:35.66,ENG,345,0,0,0,,All right, Rumpel, what's going on? What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:39.00,ENG,346,0,0,0,,No, Shrek, it's not what I've done. It's what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:42.96,ENG,347,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, the King and Queen signed their kingdom over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.14,0:29:44.55,ENG,348,0,0,0,,They would never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.72,0:29:49.35,ENG,349,0,0,0,,They would if I promised them all their problems would disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.85,0:29:53.18,ENG,350,0,0,0,,And then they disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.53,0:30:03.91,ENG,351,0,0,0,,They would have done anything
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.07,0:30:06.20,ENG,352,0,0,0,,if they thought it would end their daughter's curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:08.74,ENG,353,0,0,0,,I ended Fiona's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:12.24,ENG,354,0,0,0,,How could you when you never existed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.41,0:30:15.41,ENG,355,0,0,0,,You better start making sense, you dirty little man!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:17.87,ENG,356,0,0,0,,Here, let me spell it out for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:22.37,ENG,357,0,0,0,,You gave me a day from your past, a day you couldn't even remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:26.76,ENG,358,0,0,0,,A day when you were an innocent, mindless little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.39,0:30:31.97,ENG,359,0,0,0,,You took the day I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:35.14,ENG,360,0,0,0,,No, Shrek. You gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.31,0:30:38.85,ENG,361,0,0,0,,Enjoy this while you can, Stiltskin, because when this day is up...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.02,0:30:41.73,ENG,362,0,0,0,,But you haven't heard the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:47.61,ENG,363,0,0,0,,Since you were never born, once this day comes to an end, so will you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.66,0:30:53.29,ENG,364,0,0,0,,Where's Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:55.20,ENG,365,0,0,0,,Where's my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:58.58,ENG,366,0,0,0,,Silly little ogre. You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:01.29,ENG,367,0,0,0,,You see, you were never born.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.59,ENG,368,0,0,0,,You never met Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.76,0:31:07.34,ENG,369,0,0,0,,Your kids don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.22,0:31:13.43,ENG,370,0,0,0,,How's that for a metaphysical paradox?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.27,0:31:17.68,ENG,371,0,0,0,,Looks like you got exactly what you wanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.69,0:31:21.94,ENG,372,0,0,0,,- Happy Ogre Day! - Rumpel!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.94,0:31:25.22,ENG,373,0,0,0,,Get him, witches!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:39.00,ENG,374,0,0,0,,You know what'd help morale around here? Flip-flop Fridays.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:41.84,ENG,375,0,0,0,,Feet be comfortable with the breeze on your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.84,0:31:50.50,ENG,376,0,0,0,,Come on, girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.15,0:32:04.85,ENG,377,0,0,0,,Lock all the doors, you worthless witches! Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.65,0:32:09.28,ENG,378,0,0,0,,I'll be right back, Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.45,0:32:12.86,ENG,379,0,0,0,,I don't know you! I don't know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.35,0:32:34.34,ENG,380,0,0,0,,I'm glad I'm not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.02,0:32:40.35,ENG,381,0,0,0,,Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.56,0:32:42.59,ENG,382,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.03,0:32:52.57,ENG,383,0,0,0,,No, not my pretty ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.04,0:32:58.86,ENG,384,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:12.04,ENG,385,0,0,0,,Wolfie?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:14.54,ENG,386,0,0,0,,My angry wig.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:26.56,ENG,387,0,0,0,,Help! I've been kidnapped by a deranged, unbalanced ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.73,0:33:28.14,ENG,388,0,0,0,,Donkey! Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.32,0:33:31.23,ENG,389,0,0,0,,Watch it with your pointy hooves!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.29,0:33:39.91,ENG,390,0,0,0,,- Just take my wallet! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:42.07,ENG,391,0,0,0,,I'm being ass-napped!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.71,0:33:43.87,ENG,392,0,0,0,,Animal cruelty! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.12,ENG,393,0,0,0,,You need to calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.29,0:33:47.46,ENG,394,0,0,0,,I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:50.29,ENG,395,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hurt you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.26,0:33:53.13,ENG,396,0,0,0,,Good. I'm gonna let go...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:55.76,ENG,397,0,0,0,,...right... now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.46,ENG,398,0,0,0,,Please! Eat my face last! Send my hooves to my mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.64,0:34:01.09,ENG,399,0,0,0,,Donkey! You've got to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.27,0:34:03.84,ENG,400,0,0,0,,- Why should I trust you? - Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.02,0:34:06.10,ENG,401,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.78,0:34:11.10,ENG,402,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:19.83,ENG,403,0,0,0,,∮ Regardless of spring, summer, autumn, and winter

 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:22.83,ENG,404,0,0,0,,∮ You just need to call me out

 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:25.83,ENG,405,0,0,0,,∮ I will be by your side

 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.93,0:34:32.83,ENG,406,0,0,0,,∮ I am your friend

 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.94,0:34:53.18,ENG,407,0,0,0,,Fine! Go ahead! Run away! Who needs you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.73,0:35:29.40,ENG,408,0,0,0,,I've never seen an ogre cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.90,0:35:36.61,ENG,409,0,0,0,,I'm not crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.78,0:35:38.82,ENG,410,0,0,0,,It's nothing to be ashamed of. I cry all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.99,0:35:41.91,ENG,411,0,0,0,,Just thinking about my grandma, or thinking about baby kittens,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:46.40,ENG,412,0,0,0,,or my grandma kissing a baby kitten, or a little baby grandma kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:50.70,ENG,413,0,0,0,,- That is so darn sad. - I said, I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.88,0:35:52.75,ENG,414,0,0,0,,Take it easy, I'm only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:54.74,ENG,415,0,0,0,,It's none of my business why you're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:57.08,ENG,416,0,0,0,,By the way, why are you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.26,0:36:00.13,ENG,417,0,0,0,,I was tricked into signing something I shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.30,0:36:02.59,ENG,418,0,0,0,,You signed up for one of them time-shares, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:05.43,ENG,419,0,0,0,,No. I signed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.10,0:36:08.59,ENG,420,0,0,0,,You should never sign a contract with Rumpelstiltskin!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:10.10,ENG,421,0,0,0,,Yeah, I got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.27,0:36:12.26,ENG,422,0,0,0,,- His fine print is crafty. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.44,0:36:14.76,ENG,423,0,0,0,,- His exit clauses are sneaky. - Yeah, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.61,0:36:18.06,ENG,424,0,0,0,,- What did you say? - I'm talking about the exit clause.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.24,0:36:19.40,ENG,425,0,0,0,,Used to be, you had to guess his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.57,0:36:21.48,ENG,426,0,0,0,,but now everybody knows who Rumpelstiltskin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.66,0:36:23.28,ENG,427,0,0,0,,Donkey, I've read the fine print.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.45,0:36:25.77,ENG,428,0,0,0,,There's nothing about an exit clause in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.95,0:36:27.86,ENG,429,0,0,0,,Well, you didn't expect him to make it easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.04,0:36:30.28,ENG,430,0,0,0,,Here, let me show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.46,0:36:31.95,ENG,431,0,0,0,,I didn't spend all that time around them witches
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.12,0:36:33.78,ENG,432,0,0,0,,without picking up a few tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:36.17,ENG,433,0,0,0,,Your tiny, little ogre brain couldn't begin to comprehend
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.34,0:36:38.62,ENG,434,0,0,0,,the complexity of my polygonic foldability skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.80,0:36:40.04,ENG,435,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.22,0:36:43.30,ENG,436,0,0,0,,Hey, I can't get my origami on unless you back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.47,0:36:46.75,ENG,437,0,0,0,,Thank you. OK, here's what you gotta do. You fold this piece here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.93,0:36:49.30,ENG,438,0,0,0,,make this letter match up here, bring this corner here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.47,0:36:53.64,ENG,439,0,0,0,,and if you do it just right, it will show you what to do. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:56.14,ENG,440,0,0,0,,"Try Lou's Bliss."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.15,0:37:00.18,ENG,441,0,0,0,,Who's Lou?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.36,0:37:02.15,ENG,442,0,0,0,,Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.49,0:37:09.53,ENG,443,0,0,0,,"True Love's Kiss."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.83,0:37:14.32,ENG,444,0,0,0,,You have to take me to dinner first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:18.33,ENG,445,0,0,0,,"According to fairy tale law, if not fully satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.50,0:37:22.00,ENG,446,0,0,0,,true love's kiss will render this contract null and void."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:25.67,ENG,447,0,0,0,,Donkey, you did it! Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.84,0:37:30.64,ENG,448,0,0,0,,If Fiona and I share true love's kiss, I will get my life back!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:33.72,ENG,449,0,0,0,,OK! This isn't a petting zoo! So where is this Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.35,0:37:36.81,ENG,450,0,0,0,,Well, that's just it, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.48,0:37:38.86,ENG,451,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.02,0:37:41.18,ENG,452,0,0,0,,You know, when I lose something, I always try to retrace my steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.36,0:37:43.68,ENG,453,0,0,0,,So... where did you leave her last?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.36,0:37:46.52,ENG,454,0,0,0,,The last time I saw her,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.70,0:37:49.37,ENG,455,0,0,0,,I told her I wished I'd never rescued her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.37,0:37:54.49,ENG,456,0,0,0,,- Oh, no. - Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:57.24,ENG,457,0,0,0,,Shrek! Shrek, wait! Wait, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:37:59.54,ENG,458,0,0,0,,What, are you crazy? That's the Dragon's Keep!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.71,0:38:01.62,ENG,459,0,0,0,,They keep dragons in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.51,0:38:04.92,ENG,460,0,0,0,,OK, yeah, fine! Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.09,0:38:08.01,ENG,461,0,0,0,,I'm gonna just hang back here and find us some breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.81,0:38:20.06,ENG,462,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.27,0:38:56.93,ENG,463,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:10.15,ENG,464,0,0,0,,If I didn't save Fiona...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:14.82,ENG,465,0,0,0,,...then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.38,0:39:30.17,ENG,466,0,0,0,,This is the favour Fiona was supposed to give me on the day we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:33.84,ENG,467,0,0,0,,It's a symbol of our love.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.68,0:39:35.79,ENG,468,0,0,0,,Now smell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.97,0:39:37.85,ENG,469,0,0,0,,Hey, man, get that dirty favour out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.02,0:39:41.55,ENG,470,0,0,0,,Your nose is the only chance I have of tracking down my wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.73,0:39:44.30,ENG,471,0,0,0,,so stop complaining and start smelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.48,0:39:45.94,ENG,472,0,0,0,,Smell it! Get it! Away you go, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.11,0:39:47.82,ENG,473,0,0,0,,Do I look like a bloodhound to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.99,0:39:50.39,ENG,474,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed, I'm a donkey, not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.57,0:39:53.32,ENG,475,0,0,0,,If I was a dog, they'd call me Dog, not Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.49,0:39:54.87,ENG,476,0,0,0,,And another thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:57.33,ENG,477,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.99,0:39:59.40,ENG,478,0,0,0,,I think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.04,0:40:02.33,ENG,479,0,0,0,,- Whatever it is, it's sweet. - Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:04.12,ENG,480,0,0,0,,Luscious and tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.83,ENG,481,0,0,0,,Hey! That's my wife you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.42,0:40:09.50,ENG,482,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.51,0:40:15.59,ENG,483,0,0,0,,Yeah! Waffles!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.76,0:40:18.72,ENG,484,0,0,0,,And I thought the Waffle Fairy was just a bedtime story.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.27,0:40:22.85,ENG,485,0,0,0,,Sticky stacks of golden, syrupy deliciousness!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.02,0:40:25.18,ENG,486,0,0,0,,Donkey! Don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:29.48,ENG,487,0,0,0,,There's a stack of freshly made waffles in the middle of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:31.52,ENG,488,0,0,0,,Don't you find that a wee bit suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.28,0:40:34.44,ENG,489,0,0,0,,Oh, you... I'm just... What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.61,0:40:36.57,ENG,490,0,0,0,,Bad Donkey! Mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.74,0:40:40.79,ENG,491,0,0,0,,I said, don't! Don't! No! Get away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:42.74,ENG,492,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.88,0:40:50.99,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.09,0:40:55.12,ENG,494,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:57.71,ENG,495,0,0,0,,- Are you OK? - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.89,0:41:00.97,ENG,496,0,0,0,,Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.48,0:41:05.05,ENG,497,0,0,0,,Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.23,0:41:07.98,ENG,498,0,0,0,,Help, Shrek! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.75,0:41:32.95,ENG,499,0,0,0,,Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:34.50,ENG,500,0,0,0,,Hey, it's a new guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.67,0:41:36.80,ENG,501,0,0,0,,Look at him, all dressed up in his Sunday vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.97,0:41:38.71,ENG,502,0,0,0,,He's really tiny, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.89,0:41:40.96,ENG,503,0,0,0,,Yeah. Fate has delivered us a comrade-in-arms
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.14,0:41:42.76,ENG,504,0,0,0,,and for that, we are thankful. Suit him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.93,0:41:44.89,ENG,505,0,0,0,,- Let's go, greenie. - Now, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.86,0:41:51.68,ENG,506,0,0,0,,- Hey! - Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.99,0:41:59.77,ENG,507,0,0,0,,- Welcome to the resistance. - Resistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.95,0:42:03.53,ENG,508,0,0,0,,We fight for freedom and ogres everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.00,0:42:14.63,ENG,509,0,0,0,,I didn't know we could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.80,0:42:17.29,ENG,510,0,0,0,,Help! You can't eat me! I got the mange!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.47,0:42:21.93,ENG,511,0,0,0,,- I'm poisonous! I'm all poi... - I'll take him! This order's to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.10,0:42:24.50,ENG,512,0,0,0,,Hey! I haven't removed his giblets yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.68,0:42:26.84,ENG,513,0,0,0,,Trust me, you don't want to eat this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.02,0:42:29.06,ENG,514,0,0,0,,I go down smooth, but come out fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.23,0:42:31.30,ENG,515,0,0,0,,- Let go! - Don't make Mama mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.48,0:42:32.56,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Your dinner is my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.73,0:42:34.85,ENG,517,0,0,0,,- Come on, guys! - I got to get the giblets out!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:37.02,ENG,518,0,0,0,,- She's back. - There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.88,0:42:55.96,ENG,519,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.09,0:43:00.17,ENG,520,0,0,0,,I'm so happy I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.35,0:43:09.73,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Maybe you missed orientation,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:13.39,ENG,522,0,0,0,,but for future reference, personal space is very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.69,0:43:16.52,ENG,523,0,0,0,,You don't know who I am, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.69,0:43:18.19,ENG,524,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.36,0:43:20.35,ENG,525,0,0,0,,Brogan, I have news from Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.53,0:43:22.69,ENG,526,0,0,0,,Gather the others and meet me in the war room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.86,0:43:25.36,ENG,527,0,0,0,,Gretched, make sure everyone is prepared to move out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:27.49,ENG,528,0,0,0,,- I need to talk to you. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:32.20,ENG,529,0,0,0,,OK, I know you don't remember me, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.37,0:43:34.45,ENG,530,0,0,0,,...we're married. Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.63,0:43:37.38,ENG,531,0,0,0,,And at the birthday party with some pigs and a puppet,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.55,0:43:38.96,ENG,532,0,0,0,,the villagers wanted me to sign their pitchforks,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.13,0:43:41.17,ENG,533,0,0,0,,and this boy kept saying, "Do the roar."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:43.75,ENG,534,0,0,0,,Then I punched the cakes that the pigs ate and the next thing I knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.93,0:43:46.25,ENG,535,0,0,0,,my donkey fell in your waffle hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.81,0:43:51.30,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Right? Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.06,0:43:55.68,ENG,537,0,0,0,,I guess I must have kicked him harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.86,0:43:58.06,ENG,538,0,0,0,,Fiona, I need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.57,0:44:02.06,ENG,539,0,0,0,,Witches! All right, everyone, you know the drill!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.24,0:44:04.06,ENG,540,0,0,0,,- Fiona! - Witches! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.24,0:44:06.31,ENG,541,0,0,0,,- Witches! Witches! - Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.23,0:44:38.01,ENG,542,0,0,0,,Fiona, that's the third patrol today. We can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.19,0:44:41.77,ENG,543,0,0,0,,Trust me, Brogan. After tonight, we won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:46.53,ENG,544,0,0,0,,- That's your wife? - That's my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.95,0:44:49.98,ENG,545,0,0,0,,Well, I see who wears the chain mail in your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:58.16,ENG,546,0,0,0,,Some people like to look at the goblet as... as half empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.33,0:45:02.33,ENG,547,0,0,0,,Me, I like to look at it as half full.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.17,0:45:06.29,ENG,548,0,0,0,,We've gone from the bottom to the top, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.47,0:45:09.59,ENG,549,0,0,0,,But we're not just an empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.14,0:45:11.38,ENG,550,0,0,0,,We're a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.39,0:45:16.09,ENG,551,0,0,0,,Everyone has got their cupcake? Cupcake, cupcake? Good. Yes? Baba?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.27,0:45:17.30,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.48,0:45:20.68,ENG,553,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, we have put away a lot of ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.86,0:45:25.02,ENG,554,0,0,0,,And so one got away. Who cares? It's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.53,0:45:27.60,ENG,555,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.78,0:45:30.53,ENG,556,0,0,0,,It's not like it's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.70,0:45:34.62,ENG,557,0,0,0,,Except... funny thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.79,0:45:38.29,ENG,558,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, the ogre who got away is Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:41.29,ENG,559,0,0,0,,And if he shares a kiss with Fiona by sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.46,0:45:44.63,ENG,560,0,0,0,,it is the end of the world! Our world!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.80,0:45:46.67,ENG,561,0,0,0,,My empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.22,0:45:52.67,ENG,562,0,0,0,,But, as I was saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.85,0:45:56.89,ENG,563,0,0,0,,I like to look at the goblet as half full.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.35,0:46:00.34,ENG,564,0,0,0,,Yelling makes me so parched.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.52,0:46:04.35,ENG,565,0,0,0,,Would anyone care for some water? Wet your whistle?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.52,0:46:07.39,ENG,566,0,0,0,,A clear, crisp, delicious glass...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.57,0:46:10.74,ENG,567,0,0,0,,...of agua purificada?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.91,0:46:13.23,ENG,568,0,0,0,,Anybody's thirsty? Nobody's thirsty? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.24,0:46:16.23,ENG,569,0,0,0,,Well, then does anyone care to tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.41,0:46:19.03,ENG,570,0,0,0,,what it's going to take to get this ogre? You.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.21,0:46:20.32,ENG,571,0,0,0,,Faster brooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.08,ENG,572,0,0,0,,- No! - Pointier hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.25,0:46:25.75,ENG,573,0,0,0,,- No! You! - Maybe we could hire a professional bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.80,0:46:29.75,ENG,574,0,0,0,,What a world! What a world!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.38,0:46:34.30,ENG,575,0,0,0,,You know, actually not a bad idea. Baba!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.93,0:46:36.55,ENG,576,0,0,0,,I need a bounty hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.72,0:46:39.89,ENG,577,0,0,0,,And if music doth soothe the savage beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.06,0:46:43.26,ENG,578,0,0,0,,...then I think I might know just the person!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.61,0:46:49.85,ENG,579,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone. Word has come from Far Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.03,0:46:53.19,ENG,580,0,0,0,,Stiltskin is leading tonight's ogre hunt himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.36,0:46:55.07,ENG,581,0,0,0,,- He's never done that before. - What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.24,0:46:57.07,ENG,582,0,0,0,,I bet that's because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.24,0:46:58.99,ENG,583,0,0,0,,If that cupcake-eating clown
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.16,0:47:02.28,ENG,584,0,0,0,,finally leaves the safety of his filthy witch nest...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:04.24,ENG,585,0,0,0,,...he'll be vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.42,0:47:07.58,ENG,586,0,0,0,,The plan's simple. If they follow the usual patrol route,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.75,0:47:09.88,ENG,587,0,0,0,,they'll reach the river by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.05,0:47:13.55,ENG,588,0,0,0,,We'll be concealed along this road, waiting for his caravan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.72,0:47:17.05,ENG,589,0,0,0,,Once they reach the clearing, I'll give the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.22,0:47:19.09,ENG,590,0,0,0,,And then we attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.85,0:47:28.10,ENG,591,0,0,0,,And when the smoke clears... Wait, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.27,0:47:29.55,ENG,592,0,0,0,,That's my chimichanga stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.65,0:47:32.81,ENG,593,0,0,0,,No, Cookie. We won't be needing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:36.69,ENG,594,0,0,0,,Trust me, Fiona. Y'all gonna be really hungry after this ambush, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.62,0:47:39.41,ENG,595,0,0,0,,Go and finish your little speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.16,0:47:43.61,ENG,596,0,0,0,,All right, as I was saying, when the smoke clears,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.79,0:47:47.49,ENG,597,0,0,0,,Rumpelstiltskin is gone and the chimichangas have been eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.67,0:47:50.29,ENG,598,0,0,0,,Far Far Away will finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:52.21,ENG,599,0,0,0,,- And so will we. - Spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.38,0:47:55.63,ENG,600,0,0,0,,We move out as soon as Rumpel leaves the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.97,0:48:00.18,ENG,601,0,0,0,,- Man, this is serious! - Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.35,0:48:02.92,ENG,602,0,0,0,,How am I ever gonna get her to kiss me before sunrise?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.10,0:48:04.64,ENG,603,0,0,0,,Actually, I was talking about the revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.81,0:48:06.30,ENG,604,0,0,0,,Revolution?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.39,ENG,605,0,0,0,,Why don't you just tell her what you told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.56,0:48:11.19,ENG,606,0,0,0,,About how you're her true love and you came from an alternate universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.36,0:48:13.15,ENG,607,0,0,0,,Well, while I'm at it, why don't I tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.32,0:48:15.31,ENG,608,0,0,0,,that you're married to a fire-breathing dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.49,0:48:18.52,ENG,609,0,0,0,,and you have little, mutant donkey-dragon babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.03,0:48:20.19,ENG,610,0,0,0,,I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.37,0:48:23.28,ENG,611,0,0,0,,You saw what happened. She's gonna think I'm crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.45,0:48:24.65,ENG,612,0,0,0,,I'm a daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:28.20,ENG,613,0,0,0,,You know what? If I got Fiona to kiss me once...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.21,0:48:32.00,ENG,614,0,0,0,,...then I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.88,0:48:35.09,ENG,615,0,0,0,,Shrek, do my babies have hooves or talons?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.26,0:48:36.83,ENG,616,0,0,0,,Donkey...!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.01,0:48:38.42,ENG,617,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.89,0:48:41.05,ENG,618,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.06,0:48:50.14,ENG,619,0,0,0,,You should not be here, senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.31,0:48:51.69,ENG,620,0,0,0,,Puss?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.20,0:48:58.90,ENG,621,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.75,0:49:15.21,ENG,622,0,0,0,,Feed me, if you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.38,0:49:18.71,ENG,623,0,0,0,,Puss, what happened to you? You got so fa...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.09,0:49:23.09,ENG,624,0,0,0,,- Fancy... - Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.26,0:49:25.84,ENG,625,0,0,0,,Well, where's your hat? Where's your belt?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.02,0:49:27.76,ENG,626,0,0,0,,Your wee little boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.93,0:49:30.39,ENG,627,0,0,0,,Boots? For a cat? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.56,0:49:33.65,ENG,628,0,0,0,,But you're Puss in Boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.27,0:49:35.85,ENG,629,0,0,0,,Maybe once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.03,0:49:37.57,ENG,630,0,0,0,,But that is a name I have outgrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.74,0:49:39.39,ENG,631,0,0,0,,That's not the only thing you've outgrown.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.57,0:49:43.65,ENG,632,0,0,0,,Hey! I may have let myself go a little since retirement,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.83,0:49:46.40,ENG,633,0,0,0,,but hanging up my sword was the best decision of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.58,0:49:49.61,ENG,634,0,0,0,,I have all the cream I can drink and all the mice I can chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:52.62,ENG,635,0,0,0,,I'll get him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.79,0:49:55.20,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Puss, what have I done to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.38,0:49:56.84,ENG,637,0,0,0,,You've gone soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.63,0:50:01.79,ENG,638,0,0,0,,Well, I do get brushed twice a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.97,0:50:04.59,ENG,639,0,0,0,,Look, it's not too late to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.76,0:50:07.00,ENG,640,0,0,0,,All you have to do is help me get a kiss from Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.18,0:50:10.30,ENG,641,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.48,0:50:13.43,ENG,642,0,0,0,,Well, I know how stressful mounting a rebellion can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.60,0:50:15.60,ENG,643,0,0,0,,...rallying the troops, planning attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.77,0:50:19.56,ENG,644,0,0,0,,so I brought you a little something to ease the tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.11,0:50:21.19,ENG,645,0,0,0,,A gift basket?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:23.98,ENG,646,0,0,0,,You're welcome. So let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.16,0:50:26.53,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Heart-shaped box of slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.16,0:50:29.61,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Skunk-scented candle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.79,0:50:34.16,ENG,649,0,0,0,,- Look, this really isn't the... - What's this? Coupons!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:36.37,ENG,650,0,0,0,,Let's see, "Good for one free foot massage."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.54,0:50:38.87,ENG,651,0,0,0,,"A mud facial!" Oh, and here's one...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.05,0:50:42.58,ENG,652,0,0,0,,"Good for one free kiss." Let's cash it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.76,0:50:44.75,ENG,653,0,0,0,,Look, I don't know what this is all about,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.93,0:50:46.47,ENG,654,0,0,0,,but I'm trying to run a revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.64,0:50:48.84,ENG,655,0,0,0,,So unless you have Rumpelstiltskin's head in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.01,0:50:51.14,ENG,656,0,0,0,,I suggest you take your gift basket,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.31,0:50:55.01,ENG,657,0,0,0,,get out of my tent and go make yourself useful!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.69,0:50:59.98,ENG,658,0,0,0,,Wow. You're right. I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.15,0:51:03.19,ENG,659,0,0,0,,I was just trying to be friendly. No hard feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.82,0:51:05.85,ENG,660,0,0,0,,An apologetic hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.07,0:51:08.35,ENG,661,0,0,0,,And a quick kiss goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.87,0:51:10.90,ENG,662,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.50,0:51:13.65,ENG,663,0,0,0,,Wait! Is that mistletoe I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.37,0:51:18.74,ENG,664,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrek! Are my babies cute, or do they make people feel uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:22.04,ENG,665,0,0,0,,- Where'd we find that guy? - Could it be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.21,0:51:26.43,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Have the years of prim and pampery made me soft?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.59,0:51:29.51,ENG,667,0,0,0,,Don't be silly. Now who's a pretty kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:31.22,ENG,668,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.06,0:51:41.60,ENG,669,0,0,0,,Daddy thinks you look real nice, Fifi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.90,0:51:43.93,ENG,670,0,0,0,,Honk.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.11,0:51:45.69,ENG,671,0,0,0,,All right, Piggies, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.86,0:51:48.07,ENG,672,0,0,0,,Don't forget to take her little potty box with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.03,0:51:50.99,ENG,673,0,0,0,,This little piggy wants to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.16,0:51:54.44,ENG,674,0,0,0,,- Mr. Stiltskin! He's here. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.22,0:52:11.38,ENG,675,0,0,0,,Pied Piper. How was your commute?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.47,0:52:14.55,ENG,676,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.72,0:52:16.47,ENG,677,0,0,0,,You call this guy a bounty hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.64,0:52:19.51,ENG,678,0,0,0,,What's he gonna do, flute those ogres a lullaby?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.49,0:52:33.12,ENG,679,0,0,0,,OK, got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.33,0:52:36.45,ENG,680,0,0,0,,Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.75,0:52:42.13,ENG,681,0,0,0,,All right, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.46,0:52:49.13,ENG,682,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time to pay the piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.30,0:52:54.05,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Griselda, seriously, it's time to pay the piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.22,0:52:57.26,ENG,684,0,0,0,,Now go get my cheque book! Go! Move! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.43,0:52:59.43,ENG,685,0,0,0,,Things are getting real sloppy around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.86,0:53:04.68,ENG,686,0,0,0,,Here, now make sure they eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.86,0:53:08.14,ENG,687,0,0,0,,You can't end tyranny on an empty stomach! Go on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.32,0:53:09.81,ENG,688,0,0,0,,Din-din!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.58,0:53:20.45,ENG,689,0,0,0,,- Come on, Donkey. - One more time, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.62,0:53:22.91,ENG,690,0,0,0,,All right, but this is the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.46,0:53:25.49,ENG,691,0,0,0,,Here it comes. Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.84,0:53:32.67,ENG,692,0,0,0,,I see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.60,0:53:41.47,ENG,693,0,0,0,,That's quite a friend you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.64,0:53:43.77,ENG,694,0,0,0,,I can see why you haven't eaten him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.94,0:53:46.56,ENG,695,0,0,0,,Donkey! I hate to pull you away from your adoring public,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.73,0:53:49.02,ENG,696,0,0,0,,but I'm not getting anywhere with Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.19,0:53:52.28,ENG,697,0,0,0,,- I need your help! - Hey, everybody. Who wants dessert?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.07,0:53:57.11,ENG,698,0,0,0,,- Where'd you get these? - Fiona's garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.28,0:54:00.20,ENG,699,0,0,0,,Just another gift from some clueless lover boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.00,0:54:03.66,ENG,700,0,0,0,,That's a good one, Cookie!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:07.67,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Anyone who knows Fiona knows this stuff ain't gonna work on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.84,0:54:09.33,ENG,702,0,0,0,,Works on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.51,0:54:12.38,ENG,703,0,0,0,,Donkey, what am I gonna do? It's like I don't even know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.55,0:54:15.92,ENG,704,0,0,0,,You in trouble, Romeo. The only thing Fiona cares about is her cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.09,0:54:19.09,ENG,705,0,0,0,,- To the cause! - To the cause!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.27,0:54:22.43,ENG,706,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.87,0:54:45.90,ENG,707,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.92,0:54:52.00,ENG,708,0,0,0,,- Nice moves. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:54.88,ENG,709,0,0,0,,What does it look like? I'm getting ready for ambush action.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.05,0:54:57.72,ENG,710,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I always like to quad my lutes
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.89,0:55:02.05,ENG,711,0,0,0,,and do some scrunches before an operational... op.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.22,0:55:03.25,ENG,712,0,0,0,,This one taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.43,0:55:05.26,ENG,713,0,0,0,,We use that to clean the toilets.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.19,0:55:10.31,ENG,714,0,0,0,,And we use that one to clean the thing we clean the toilets with.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.48,0:55:11.76,ENG,715,0,0,0,,I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.86,0:55:13.97,ENG,716,0,0,0,,There you go, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.13,0:55:33.29,ENG,717,0,0,0,,Hey... Scott?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.62,ENG,718,0,0,0,,My name is Shrek, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:38.63,ENG,719,0,0,0,,You're going to get yourself killed at the ambush tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:42.42,ENG,720,0,0,0,,I'll be fine. I think I can take care of myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.93,0:55:44.17,ENG,721,0,0,0,,Well, let's see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.60,0:55:47.05,ENG,722,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.23,0:55:48.26,ENG,723,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.98,0:55:54.31,ENG,724,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.89,0:56:28.17,ENG,725,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.52,0:56:29.85,ENG,726,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.19,0:56:33.90,ENG,727,0,0,0,,The dragon goes under the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.06,0:56:36.31,ENG,728,0,0,0,,through the loop and finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.48,0:56:38.06,ENG,729,0,0,0,,Into the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.70,0:56:48.03,ENG,730,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.75,0:56:51.87,ENG,731,0,0,0,,OK. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.50,0:56:54.21,ENG,732,0,0,0,,It seems like you can handle yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.38,0:56:56.33,ENG,733,0,0,0,,- But, Fiona... - Go get ready for the mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.50,0:56:59.50,ENG,734,0,0,0,,- I will, but Fiona... - That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.60,0:57:14.02,ENG,735,0,0,0,,All right, let's get those axes sharpened and weapons packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.19,0:57:15.76,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Preparation is half the battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.94,0:57:21.40,ENG,737,0,0,0,,Ogre! Un momento! Un momento!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.90,0:57:24.44,ENG,738,0,0,0,,Ogre, ogre, un momento!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:27.35,ENG,739,0,0,0,,Just give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.53,0:57:30.37,ENG,740,0,0,0,,Look, Puss, I'm a little pressed for time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:33.70,ENG,741,0,0,0,,I am not believing what I have just witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.87,0:57:35.53,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Back there, you and Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.71,0:57:38.38,ENG,743,0,0,0,,There was a spark... a spark inside her heart
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.55,0:57:40.25,ENG,744,0,0,0,,I thought was long extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.42,0:57:44.83,ENG,745,0,0,0,,It was as if, for one moment, Fiona had actually found her true love!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.01,0:57:48.34,ENG,746,0,0,0,,I am her true love. I ended her curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.93,0:57:50.76,ENG,747,0,0,0,,You know of her curse?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.93,0:57:54.22,ENG,748,0,0,0,,By day, one way, by night another.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.39,0:57:57.15,ENG,749,0,0,0,,This shall be the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.31,0:58:00.81,ENG,750,0,0,0,,Until you find true love's first kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.11,0:58:05.98,ENG,751,0,0,0,,...and then take love's true form.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.87,0:58:08.74,ENG,752,0,0,0,,You even know the little rhyme!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.91,0:58:11.40,ENG,753,0,0,0,,It is true! You are the one! You must prove it to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.58,0:58:13.74,ENG,754,0,0,0,,- How? - Convince her!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.91,0:58:15.24,ENG,755,0,0,0,,Go to her when she is alone
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.42,0:58:19.08,ENG,756,0,0,0,,and tell her something that only her true love would know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.25,0:58:20.79,ENG,757,0,0,0,,Know about what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.80,0:58:25.50,ENG,758,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's a whole lot of kitty! Shrek, can we keep him?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.65,0:58:44.48,ENG,759,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.65,0:58:47.36,ENG,760,0,0,0,,Pardon me, guys! Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.53,0:58:50.40,ENG,761,0,0,0,,Look, Donkey, the chimichanga cart! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.58,0:58:53.45,ENG,762,0,0,0,,Andale! After him, burro! Donkey, vamonos!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.62,0:58:55.74,ENG,763,0,0,0,,Man, you are a cat-astrophe!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.91,0:58:58.29,ENG,764,0,0,0,,And you are ri-donkey-Ious!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.17,0:59:06.96,ENG,765,0,0,0,,I'll scout ahead. Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:13.89,ENG,766,0,0,0,,Secure your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.24,0:59:32.78,ENG,767,0,0,0,,- It's quite a view from up here. - What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.95,0:59:33.98,ENG,768,0,0,0,,Get back in position!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.16,0:59:37.24,ENG,769,0,0,0,,You need to know, once and for all, who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.41,0:59:38.87,ENG,770,0,0,0,,You are going to ruin everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.04,0:59:41.28,ENG,771,0,0,0,,Ruin everything? Actually, I'm gonna fix everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.46,0:59:44.16,ENG,772,0,0,0,,The ogres, Rumpel, your curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:47.41,ENG,773,0,0,0,,How do you know about my curse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.59,0:59:52.00,ENG,774,0,0,0,,OK, OK, please, Fiona... Just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.18,0:59:54.71,ENG,775,0,0,0,,I can explain everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.23,1:00:01.01,ENG,776,0,0,0,,- Where's Fiona's signal? - What's she waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.19,1:00:04.02,ENG,777,0,0,0,,- He's going to get away! - No, he's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.59,1:00:33.37,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Listen, I don't know who you are or how you know about my curse,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.55,1:00:35.43,ENG,779,0,0,0,,but if any of these ogres find out I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.60,1:00:38.85,ENG,780,0,0,0,,- A beautiful princess? - That is not who I am! Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.02,1:00:42.05,ENG,781,0,0,0,,- Look, I know you're upset. - You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.23,1:00:43.89,ENG,782,0,0,0,,I know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.06,1:00:47.06,ENG,783,0,0,0,,I know you sing so beautifully that birds explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:49.39,ENG,784,0,0,0,,- Big deal. - I know that when you sign your name,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.57,1:00:52.24,ENG,785,0,0,0,,- you put a heart over the "I". - So what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:54.40,ENG,786,0,0,0,,I know that when you see a shooting star,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.57,1:00:56.56,ENG,787,0,0,0,,you cross your fingers on both hands,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.74,1:01:00.52,ENG,788,0,0,0,,squinch up your nose and you make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:03.57,ENG,789,0,0,0,,I know that you don't like the covers wrapped around your feet,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.75,1:01:05.41,ENG,790,0,0,0,,and I know that you sleep by candlelight
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.58,1:01:07.58,ENG,791,0,0,0,,because every time you close your eyes...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.63,1:01:11.63,ENG,792,0,0,0,,...you're afraid you're gonna wake up back in that tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.34,1:01:15.46,ENG,793,0,0,0,,But, most importantly, Fiona...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.47,1:01:20.05,ENG,794,0,0,0,,...I know that the reason you turn human every day...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.35,1:01:24.43,ENG,795,0,0,0,,...is because you've never been kissed...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.85,1:01:26.97,ENG,796,0,0,0,,...well...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.48,1:01:30.64,ENG,797,0,0,0,,...by me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:44.12,ENG,798,0,0,0,,- You move fast. - It's not me doing the moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.12,1:01:48.28,ENG,799,0,0,0,,- Why is this happening?! - Love?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.46,1:01:51.58,ENG,800,0,0,0,,- No, I'm being forced to dance! - By love!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.75,1:01:54.51,ENG,801,0,0,0,,No, I can't stop myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.67,1:01:57.51,ENG,802,0,0,0,,Please! Make it stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.68,1:01:59.84,ENG,803,0,0,0,,I can't control myself!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.68,1:02:06.80,ENG,804,0,0,0,,Yeah! Cookie's bringing the heat out of the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.06,1:02:11.52,ENG,805,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's the Piper!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.69,1:02:17.31,ENG,806,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let this happen, and it's all because of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:21.90,ENG,807,0,0,0,,- If you'd just let me kiss you! - What? You're insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.84,1:02:40.92,ENG,808,0,0,0,,We must do something before they fandango themselves into oblivion!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.10,1:02:44.51,ENG,809,0,0,0,,- What can we do? - First, you must stop dancing!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.68,1:02:47.39,ENG,810,0,0,0,,When somebody tooties that fluty, I got to shake my booty!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.56,1:02:49.18,ENG,811,0,0,0,,Then it's up to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.74,1:03:01.57,ENG,812,0,0,0,,Hurry! We must get them away from the music!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:06.99,ENG,813,0,0,0,,Puss and Donkey to the rescue! We saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.69,1:03:35.18,ENG,814,0,0,0,,Donkey... Can I borrow your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.36,1:03:36.44,ENG,815,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.40,1:03:38.73,ENG,816,0,0,0,,No. Hell...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:44.23,ENG,817,0,0,0,,I don't care how big your eyes get, player, it's not going down.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.00,1:03:51.08,ENG,818,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.58,1:03:52.61,ENG,819,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.79,1:03:55.25,ENG,820,0,0,0,,- Where are you going? - To save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.42,1:03:58.25,ENG,821,0,0,0,,- How, by getting yourself killed? - If that's what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:03:59.70,ENG,822,0,0,0,,Puss, say something.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.88,1:04:01.75,ENG,823,0,0,0,,- Puss? - Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.93,1:04:04.05,ENG,824,0,0,0,,That's how you knew so much about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.22,1:04:07.30,ENG,825,0,0,0,,- Fiona, wait! Kiss me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.47,1:04:09.10,ENG,826,0,0,0,,It's the only way to save your friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.27,1:04:10.30,ENG,827,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.48,1:04:13.59,ENG,828,0,0,0,,You used to believe that a single kiss could solve everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.21,1:04:44.42,ENG,829,0,0,0,,I don't understand. This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:47.21,ENG,830,0,0,0,,True love's kiss was supposed to fix everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.39,1:04:49.46,ENG,831,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know, that's what they told me, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.64,1:04:51.96,ENG,832,0,0,0,,True love didn't get me out of that tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.14,1:04:54.85,ENG,833,0,0,0,,I did. I saved myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:04:59.47,ENG,834,0,0,0,,Don't you get it? It's all just a big fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.65,1:05:02.06,ENG,835,0,0,0,,Fiona, don't say that. It does exist!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:03.61,ENG,836,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.78,1:05:06.48,ENG,837,0,0,0,,Did you grow up locked away in a dragon's keep?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:09.49,ENG,838,0,0,0,,Did you live all alone in a miserable tower?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:11.98,ENG,839,0,0,0,,Did you cry yourself to sleep every night,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.16,1:05:14.73,ENG,840,0,0,0,,waiting for a true love that never came?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.04,1:05:19.62,ENG,841,0,0,0,,But... But I'm your true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.79,1:05:23.21,ENG,842,0,0,0,,Then where were you when I needed you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.06,1:05:37.55,ENG,843,0,0,0,,Maybe you kissed her wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.19,1:05:39.22,ENG,844,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.77,1:05:41.56,ENG,845,0,0,0,,The kiss didn't work...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.52,1:05:44.85,ENG,846,0,0,0,,...because Fiona doesn't love me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.41,1:05:53.12,ENG,847,0,0,0,,Don't despair, fellow ogres!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.29,1:05:57.53,ENG,848,0,0,0,,They can put us in cages, but they can't cage our honour!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.92,1:06:01.83,ENG,849,0,0,0,,Shrek and Fiona are together?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.92,1:06:07.17,ENG,850,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've heard enough of your toot-a-lee-toots! You blew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.34,1:06:09.00,ENG,851,0,0,0,,Wolfie! My speech wig.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.18,1:06:13.42,ENG,852,0,0,0,,Baba! Ready my makeup. And Piper, pull my socks up.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.89,1:06:18.51,ENG,853,0,0,0,,- Tight. - Attention, citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.31,1:06:23.60,ENG,854,0,0,0,,Please stay tuned for a message from our tyrannical dictator!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.98,1:06:28.40,ENG,855,0,0,0,,Hello, people. It is I, Rumpelstiltskin...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:30.65,ENG,856,0,0,0,,...shepherd of your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.49,1:06:35.44,ENG,857,0,0,0,,Recently, a certain somebody
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.62,1:06:38.95,ENG,858,0,0,0,,has jeopardized our joyous lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.92,1:06:44.87,ENG,859,0,0,0,,And that somebody is the rat-munching ogre called Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:47.33,ENG,860,0,0,0,,That is why I come to you, dear citizens.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.51,1:06:50.00,ENG,861,0,0,0,,For whomever brings me this ogre,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.18,1:06:54.17,ENG,862,0,0,0,,shall receive the deal of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.85,1:06:56.26,ENG,863,0,0,0,,Just think of it! Total and
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.43,1:06:58.14,ENG,864,0,0,0,,- complete happiness. - Ya!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.31,1:07:01.76,ENG,865,0,0,0,,Dazzling, radiant fulfilment! All your greatest wishes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.94,1:07:03.93,ENG,866,0,0,0,,- Yeah! - Your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.11,1:07:08.73,ENG,867,0,0,0,,Anything you could ever want! No strings attached!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:12.11,ENG,868,0,0,0,,But hurry, this is a limited time offer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.28,1:07:18.12,ENG,869,0,0,0,,So light your torches, sharpen your pitchforks and get your mob on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.62,1:07:21.66,ENG,870,0,0,0,,Shrek! Shrek! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.92,1:07:27.96,ENG,871,0,0,0,,Go back where you came from!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.13,1:07:32.76,ENG,872,0,0,0,,It seems that we are safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.93,1:07:35.71,ENG,873,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks a lot less pitchforky and torchy out there. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.89,1:07:39.97,ENG,874,0,0,0,,What's the point? The kiss didn't work. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.14,1:07:43.14,ENG,875,0,0,0,,Look, Shrek, I know things might seem a little bleak right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.31,1:07:45.77,ENG,876,0,0,0,,but things always work themselves out in the end, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.94,1:07:48.31,ENG,877,0,0,0,,- I bet by this time tomorrow... - Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:50.14,ENG,878,0,0,0,,There is no tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.32,1:07:54.27,ENG,879,0,0,0,,There's no day after that, and there's no day after that day after that!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.45,1:07:57.95,ENG,880,0,0,0,,My life was perfect and I'm never going to get it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.12,1:08:01.70,ENG,881,0,0,0,,If your life was so perfect, why'd you sign it away to Rumpelstiltskin?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.87,1:08:05.24,ENG,882,0,0,0,,Because I didn't know what I had until it was gone! All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.05,1:08:11.87,ENG,883,0,0,0,,I didn't know what I had.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.47,1:08:17.97,ENG,884,0,0,0,,Surrender now! I'm taking you in!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.55,1:08:22.09,ENG,885,0,0,0,,Don't try to fight it, ogre! The reward is mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.27,1:08:23.30,ENG,886,0,0,0,,Gingy?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.10,1:08:26.51,ENG,887,0,0,0,,- You unhand me, green devil! - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.69,1:08:27.97,ENG,888,0,0,0,,Collecting my bounty!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.15,1:08:30.14,ENG,889,0,0,0,,- Bounty? - What are you talking about, cracker?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.90,1:08:33.35,ENG,890,0,0,0,,Rumpelstiltskin promised the deal of a lifetime
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.53,1:08:36.53,ENG,891,0,0,0,,- for whoever could bring you in. - Deal of a lifetime?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.70,1:08:39.73,ENG,892,0,0,0,,Where all your wishes come true.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.41,1:08:42.74,ENG,893,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.54,1:08:46.24,ENG,894,0,0,0,,- I can still fix this. - How you gonna do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.42,1:08:50.71,ENG,895,0,0,0,,You know what? I'm gonna give Rumpelstiltskin exactly what he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.88,1:08:53.20,ENG,896,0,0,0,,OK, Gingy, tell me about this...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.59,1:08:59.59,ENG,897,0,0,0,,Were you going to eat that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.60,1:09:04.68,ENG,898,0,0,0,,Not Shrek. That is not Shrek. Also not Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.85,1:09:08.14,ENG,899,0,0,0,,That's not even an ogre, it is a troll! Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:09.34,ENG,900,0,0,0,,- And that... - Roar.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.52,1:09:10.55,ENG,901,0,0,0,,...is just sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.40,1:09:13.27,ENG,902,0,0,0,,And what is that supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.44,1:09:15.02,ENG,903,0,0,0,,I'm just a frightened old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:18.11,ENG,904,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him! These ogres are crafty!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.28,1:09:19.90,ENG,905,0,0,0,,That is your father painted green.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.07,1:09:22.11,ENG,906,0,0,0,,No, it's Shrek! Honest!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.66,1:09:24.69,ENG,907,0,0,0,,Take them away!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.87,1:09:27.74,ENG,908,0,0,0,,Can no one bring me Shrek?! Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.91,1:09:30.62,ENG,909,0,0,0,,How hard can it be?! I want him! I want him! I want him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.13,1:09:32.45,ENG,910,0,0,0,,Stiltskin!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.05,1:09:35.75,ENG,911,0,0,0,,I hear you're looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.59,1:09:38.55,ENG,912,0,0,0,,All right! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.72,1:09:42.17,ENG,913,0,0,0,,Who turned him in? Who gets the deal of a lifetime?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.35,1:09:44.17,ENG,914,0,0,0,,- I do. - What? But...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.35,1:09:48.26,ENG,915,0,0,0,,If I'm turning myself in, I get the deal of a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.27,1:09:55.02,ENG,916,0,0,0,,That means you have to give me anything I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.19,1:09:57.76,ENG,917,0,0,0,,No! Only true love's kiss can break your contract!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.94,1:09:59.82,ENG,918,0,0,0,,So if you thought you were just gonna...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.86,1:10:05.11,ENG,919,0,0,0,,- in here and get your life back... - I'm not here to get my life back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.66,1:10:08.07,ENG,920,0,0,0,,Then what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.84,1:10:21.33,ENG,921,0,0,0,,The ogres. They are all free.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.51,1:10:23.00,ENG,922,0,0,0,,But where is Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.18,1:10:30.51,ENG,923,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:35.14,ENG,924,0,0,0,,I don't know. Not much of a storybook ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.31,1:10:41.15,ENG,925,0,0,0,,The noble Shrek turns himself in to save a bunch of filthy ogres.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.70,1:10:44.37,ENG,926,0,0,0,,All that matters is that they're free...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.87,1:10:46.86,ENG,927,0,0,0,,...and Fiona is safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.37,1:10:51.32,ENG,928,0,0,0,,I bet Fiona would be really touched to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.00,1:10:53.28,ENG,929,0,0,0,,But, hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.46,1:10:56.37,ENG,930,0,0,0,,...I guess you can tell her yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.21,1:10:58.67,ENG,931,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.05,1:11:11.35,ENG,932,0,0,0,,Stiltskin, we had a deal! You agreed to free all ogres!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.52,1:11:12.76,ENG,933,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:17.56,ENG,934,0,0,0,,But Fiona isn't all ogre, is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.57,1:11:26.36,ENG,935,0,0,0,,By day, one way, by night, another. Blardy, blardy, blar.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.24,1:11:30.45,ENG,936,0,0,0,,Nobody's smart but me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:41.08,ENG,937,0,0,0,,That was a really brave thing you did, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.84,1:11:42.87,ENG,938,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.59,1:11:45.92,ENG,939,0,0,0,,No, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.76,1:11:48.88,ENG,940,0,0,0,,I wasn't there for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.05,1:11:51.38,ENG,941,0,0,0,,And not just at the Dragon's Keep, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.72,1:11:54.47,ENG,942,0,0,0,,...every day since.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:56.60,ENG,943,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.60,1:11:59.23,ENG,944,0,0,0,,...you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.94,1:12:03.73,ENG,945,0,0,0,,Let go of me! I have got to save Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:05.28,ENG,946,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, mule!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.45,1:12:07.94,ENG,947,0,0,0,,She's right. Rumpel's palace is locked up tighter
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.12,1:12:11.40,ENG,948,0,0,0,,- than Old Mother Hubbard's Cupboard. - And that cupboard wasn't guarded
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.58,1:12:14.58,ENG,949,0,0,0,,by a whole bunch of mean, ugly, nasty witches.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.75,1:12:17.62,ENG,950,0,0,0,,Hey! We can hear you!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.46,1:12:19.95,ENG,951,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:23.25,ENG,952,0,0,0,,We must get into the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.42,1:12:25.54,ENG,953,0,0,0,,Man, Shrek and me just busted out of that place!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.72,1:12:27.26,ENG,954,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.47,1:12:31.42,ENG,955,0,0,0,,The same way we're gonna bust in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.89,1:12:40.02,ENG,956,0,0,0,,Yay! My new pretty ball! Didn't it look bigger in the catalogue?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.19,1:12:41.77,ENG,957,0,0,0,,I guess it'll have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.24,1:12:51.95,ENG,958,0,0,0,,Witches, finally, the moment we've all been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.12,1:12:54.90,ENG,959,0,0,0,,The main event of the evening!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:58.24,ENG,960,0,0,0,,I present Shrek and Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.34,1:13:07.38,ENG,961,0,0,0,,And now, to put the past behind us once and for all,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.55,1:13:11.30,ENG,962,0,0,0,,I give you a princess's worst nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.47,1:13:15.05,ENG,963,0,0,0,,Fiona's old flame, the keeper of the keep...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.22,1:13:16.80,ENG,964,0,0,0,,...Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.79,1:13:42.08,ENG,965,0,0,0,,- Donkey? - And Puss!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.88,1:13:46.99,ENG,966,0,0,0,,In Boots!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.12,1:14:19.16,ENG,967,0,0,0,,Get them, get them, witches!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.00,1:14:22.54,ENG,968,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:29.12,ENG,969,0,0,0,,- Donkey, woo her! - Woo who?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.30,1:14:30.67,ENG,970,0,0,0,,Your wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:55.85,ENG,971,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.37,1:15:04.66,ENG,972,0,0,0,,I'll call you! We're in love!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.43,1:15:17.88,ENG,973,0,0,0,,Fiona, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.60,1:15:21.22,ENG,974,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:53.84,ENG,975,0,0,0,,- Chimichangas?! - Get 'em while they're hot!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.76,1:16:01.96,ENG,976,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.43,1:16:06.63,ENG,977,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.70,1:16:23.32,ENG,978,0,0,0,,The dragon goes under the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.45,1:16:25.95,ENG,979,0,0,0,,Through the loop!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.12,1:16:27.20,ENG,980,0,0,0,,And finally...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:28.95,ENG,981,0,0,0,,Into the castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:37.01,ENG,982,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.14,1:16:44.47,ENG,983,0,0,0,,Foo!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.31,1:16:47.64,ENG,984,0,0,0,,So long!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:51.63,ENG,985,0,0,0,,Come on, Fifi, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.81,1:16:53.69,ENG,986,0,0,0,,Go! Witches, close up the floor!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.82,1:16:57.44,ENG,987,0,0,0,,Come on, Fifi, go! Flappity flap!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.61,1:17:00.98,ENG,988,0,0,0,,Come on, go! Fly away! Up, up! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.82,1:17:03.15,ENG,989,0,0,0,,Fifi, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:09.82,ENG,990,0,0,0,,Victory is ours!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.21,1:17:21.21,ENG,991,0,0,0,,Looks like we're having curly-toed weirdo for breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:23.96,ENG,992,0,0,0,,Hey, we make a pretty good team.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:26.09,ENG,993,0,0,0,,You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:35.35,ENG,994,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.15,1:17:41.02,ENG,995,0,0,0,,His day is up. His day is...!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.61,1:17:42.77,ENG,996,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:45.52,ENG,997,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.08,1:17:51.37,ENG,998,0,0,0,,There has to be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.21,1:17:55.82,ENG,999,0,0,0,,You've already done everything for me, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.57,ENG,1000,0,0,0,,You gave me a home and a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:00.50,ENG,1001,0,0,0,,You have kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:02.66,ENG,1002,0,0,0,,We have kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.84,1:18:06.71,ENG,1003,0,0,0,,Fergus, Farkle and a little girl named...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.89,1:18:08.22,ENG,1004,0,0,0,,- Felicia. - Felicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.10,1:18:11.88,ENG,1005,0,0,0,,I always wanted to have a daughter named Felicia.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:14.09,ENG,1006,0,0,0,,And someday...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.77,1:18:17.10,ENG,1007,0,0,0,,...you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.78,1:18:30.45,ENG,1008,0,0,0,,You know what the best part of today was?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.08,1:18:37.24,ENG,1009,0,0,0,,I got the chance to fall in love with you all over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.16,1:19:13.99,ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Fiona, the sunrise!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.16,1:19:16.45,ENG,1011,0,0,0,,You're still... an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.96,1:19:21.91,ENG,1012,0,0,0,,- True love's form. - Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.67,1:19:24.33,ENG,1013,0,0,0,,The kiss worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.01,1:19:32.34,ENG,1014,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.77,1:19:43.18,ENG,1015,0,0,0,,Fifi!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.98,1:19:46.31,ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Puss!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.65,1:19:50.40,ENG,1017,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:53.66,ENG,1018,0,0,0,,No, not yet! I'm not ready! No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.80,1:20:09.26,ENG,1019,0,0,0,,I love you, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.43,1:20:12.68,ENG,1020,0,0,0,,Shrek! Shrek! Shrek! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.10,1:20:20.30,ENG,1021,0,0,0,,Everybody, I have found another cake!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.06,1:20:23.35,ENG,1022,0,0,0,,Shrek? Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:34.03,ENG,1023,0,0,0,,Fiona. I've never been better.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.20,1:20:37.86,ENG,1024,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.71,1:20:45.03,ENG,1025,0,0,0,,Happy Birthday, Farkle.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.21,1:20:47.50,ENG,1026,0,0,0,,Fergus, my little man!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.67,1:20:49.96,ENG,1027,0,0,0,,And Felicia, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.13,1:20:52.37,ENG,1028,0,0,0,,I believe this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.76,1:20:55.42,ENG,1029,0,0,0,,Thank you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:59.42,ENG,1030,0,0,0,,Hey, Uncle Shrek! How about giving my babies an encore!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.60,1:21:01.72,ENG,1031,0,0,0,,Please, senor, let us have it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.03,1:21:16.48,ENG,1032,0,0,0,,- I didn't know we could do that. - That's my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.74,1:21:19.90,ENG,1033,0,0,0,,You know, I always thought
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.08,1:21:22.45,ENG,1034,0,0,0,,that I rescued you from the Dragon's Keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.62,1:21:24.00,ENG,1035,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.17,1:21:27.75,ENG,1036,0,0,0,,No. It was you that rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.60,1:21:43.01,ENG,1037,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.84,1:23:00.17,ENG,1038,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.38,1:29:18.37,ENG,1039,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.06,0:00:40.05,CHS,2,0,0,0,,《怪物史瑞克4》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.08,0:00:45.37,CHS,3,0,0,0,,很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:49.04,CHS,4,0,0,0,,有位国王和王后 他们有个美丽的女儿 菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:51.91,CHS,5,0,0,0,,但是她中了一个可怕的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.09,0:00:56.71,CHS,6,0,0,0,,白天还是美丽可人的公主 夜幕降临后就变成可怕的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.88,0:00:59.64,CHS,7,0,0,0,,只有真爱之吻才能解除诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:03.97,CHS,8,0,0,0,,所以菲奥娜在一个被火龙看守着的高塔上等啊等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.85,CHS,9,0,0,0,,等待着真爱降临的那一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:09.34,CHS,10,0,0,0,,可是日复一日 年复一年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:13.47,CHS,11,0,0,0,,国王和王后只得孤注一掷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:07.11,CHS,12,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:10.20,CHS,13,0,0,0,,我不知道该不该这么做 莉莉安
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.37,0:02:14.70,CHS,14,0,0,0,,仙女教母说只有真爱之吻 才能打破菲奥娜的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:19.17,CHS,15,0,0,0,,我不信任那女人 哈罗德 这也许是我们最后的希望了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:22.46,CHS,16,0,0,0,,而且麦德斯国王也确实极力推荐他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.64,0:02:27.26,CHS,17,0,0,0,,但要把我们女儿的生活交给这个人?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:32.14,CHS,18,0,0,0,,他很狡猾 不诚实 而且他...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.31,0:02:34.68,CHS,19,0,0,0,,烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.53,0:02:40.07,CHS,20,0,0,0,,王后殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.11,CHS,21,0,0,0,,你...你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.03,0:02:45.78,CHS,22,0,0,0,,下去 飞飞 下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:50.29,CHS,23,0,0,0,,正如你们所见 一切尽在掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:54.16,CHS,24,0,0,0,,你真的可以结束我们女儿的诅咒?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.33,0:02:58.66,CHS,25,0,0,0,,作为回报 你要把远得要命王国转让给我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.88,CHS,26,0,0,0,,- 莉莉安 这简直是疯了 - 我们还有别的选择吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.06,0:03:12.59,CHS,27,0,0,0,,菲奥娜已经被锁在塔里太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.77,0:03:14.84,CHS,28,0,0,0,,她的青春一去便不再复返
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.02,0:03:17.69,CHS,29,0,0,0,,但拱手让出我们整个王国?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:20.77,CHS,30,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你的王国对你来说 比你的女儿更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:24.56,CHS,31,0,0,0,,没有什么比我们的女儿更重要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.57,CHS,32,0,0,0,,跳上来 飞飞 跳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.75,0:03:39.58,CHS,33,0,0,0,,只要签个字 一切问题都会化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.26,0:03:52.60,CHS,34,0,0,0,,陛下 公主 被救出来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.10,CHS,35,0,0,0,,谁救了她?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:02.81,CHS,36,0,0,0,,没人能想到一个咆哮声令人闻风丧胆的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.82,0:04:04.89,CHS,37,0,0,0,,名叫史莱克的绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.07,0:04:07.74,CHS,38,0,0,0,,会救出美丽的菲奥娜公主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.91,0:04:10.86,CHS,39,0,0,0,,一吻定情 他们结婚 还生了一堆绿怪宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.03,0:04:14.15,CHS,40,0,0,0,,远得要命王国终于迎来了和平与安宁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.33,0:04:18.71,CHS,41,0,0,0,,哦 他们还真美 还从此永远幸福快乐地生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.29,0:04:23.08,CHS,42,0,0,0,,先生 你撕书要赔偿的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.46,0:04:27.00,CHS,43,0,0,0,,或许我们可以为此做个交易 小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:30.88,CHS,44,0,0,0,,- 噢 我不是个真的男孩 - 你想变成真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.47,0:04:37.80,CHS,45,0,0,0,,没人需要你那些交易了 烂皮儿臭侏儒!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:47.32,CHS,46,0,0,0,,我真希望那绿怪从来没存在过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:01.58,CHS,47,0,0,0,,醒醒 爸爸 起床
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.34,0:05:05.50,CHS,48,0,0,0,,- 早安 - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.59,0:05:10.17,CHS,49,0,0,0,,嗝打出来总比憋着好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:12.08,CHS,50,0,0,0,,那是我的台词
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.26,0:05:15.22,CHS,51,0,0,0,,我的小费格斯是不是有点... 噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:18.64,CHS,52,0,0,0,,绿怪的超级大臭味啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.81,0:05:22.01,CHS,53,0,0,0,,真是恶魔般的气味
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.23,0:05:27.35,CHS,54,0,0,0,,在左手边 可爱的大家伙告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.53,0:05:29.90,CHS,55,0,0,0,,你无须更换内裤来改变世界
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.11,0:05:33.24,CHS,56,0,0,0,,很好奇史莱克在那干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:36.69,CHS,57,0,0,0,,把脚伸进来 把脚... 这根本穿不上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:40.99,CHS,58,0,0,0,,好了 穿过桥下 绕过火龙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:43.54,CHS,59,0,0,0,,最后 抵达城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:50.25,CHS,60,0,0,0,,来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.30,CHS,61,0,0,0,,∮ 不论春夏秋冬，你只需叫我一声 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.43,CHS,62,0,0,0,,然后史莱克吻了公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:01.64,CHS,63,0,0,0,,她变成了美丽的绿怪 然后他们从此...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:02.84,CHS,64,0,0,0,,永远幸福...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:04.48,CHS,65,0,0,0,,- 快乐地... - 生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:12.43,CHS,66,0,0,0,,看 流星
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.57,0:06:16.65,CHS,67,0,0,0,,你许了什么愿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:18.90,CHS,68,0,0,0,,每天都可以像今天这样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.54,CHS,69,0,0,0,,过来 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:34.87,CHS,70,0,0,0,,早上好 爹地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.05,0:06:36.17,CHS,71,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:39.59,CHS,72,0,0,0,,嗝打出来总比憋着好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.77,0:06:42.59,CHS,73,0,0,0,,我的小费格斯是不是有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:47.98,CHS,74,0,0,0,,好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:50.94,CHS,75,0,0,0,,可爱的大家伙告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:54.03,CHS,76,0,0,0,,你无须更换内裤来改变世界
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.16,0:06:56.19,CHS,77,0,0,0,,来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.32,CHS,78,0,0,0,,史莱克 厕所堵了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:04.45,CHS,79,0,0,0,,她变成了美丽的绿怪 然后他们从此...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:05.65,CHS,80,0,0,0,,- 永远幸福... - 快乐地...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:06.86,CHS,81,0,0,0,,生活着?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:11.79,CHS,82,0,0,0,,- 爹地 起床 - 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.92,0:07:16.79,CHS,83,0,0,0,,- 嗝打出来总比憋着好 - 可爱的大家伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.59,0:07:19.14,CHS,84,0,0,0,,- 来玩吧 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.22,CHS,85,0,0,0,,厕所又堵了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.47,CHS,86,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:28.56,CHS,87,0,0,0,,内裤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.40,0:07:31.48,CHS,88,0,0,0,,厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.65,0:07:33.77,CHS,89,0,0,0,,- 起床 起床 - 然后他们从此...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.40,CHS,90,0,0,0,,- 永远幸福... - 快乐地...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.57,0:07:36.81,CHS,91,0,0,0,,生活着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.03,0:08:19.73,CHS,92,0,0,0,,(通缉令：悬赏绿怪)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.87,CHS,93,0,0,0,,吼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:19.58,CHS,94,0,0,0,,漂亮的着陆 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:22.13,CHS,95,0,0,0,,记住 别再把服务员吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.55,0:09:27.22,CHS,96,0,0,0,,生日快乐 小宝贝们 一起来狂欢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.56,0:09:30.18,CHS,97,0,0,0,,嘿 史莱克 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.97,CHS,98,0,0,0,,史莱克先生 能不能在我的杈子上签个名
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.15,0:09:35.23,CHS,99,0,0,0,,还有我的火炬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.10,CHS,100,0,0,0,,哥们儿 你是那么凶猛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.10,CHS,101,0,0,0,,是啊 当你还是个真正的绿怪时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:41.19,CHS,102,0,0,0,,真正的绿怪?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.67,CHS,103,0,0,0,,史莱克 这是齐唱 你也得一起唱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.83,0:09:58.95,CHS,104,0,0,0,,- 不了 谢谢 - 拜托 我是你最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:03.59,CHS,105,0,0,0,,为什么成为你最好的朋友就规定我 要做一切我不想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.76,0:10:06.08,CHS,106,0,0,0,,求你了 费利西亚 别对着爸爸的耳朵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:07.51,CHS,107,0,0,0,,打扰一下 史莱克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:09.84,CHS,108,0,0,0,,你能给我儿子表演一下绿怪的咆哮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.51,CHS,109,0,0,0,,他是个超级铁杆粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:12.80,CHS,110,0,0,0,,快咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.98,0:10:15.76,CHS,111,0,0,0,,我最好还是不要咆哮了 这是我孩子们的生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:17.93,CHS,112,0,0,0,,- 快咆哮 - 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:19.43,CHS,113,0,0,0,,你怎么不去看看蛋糕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.61,0:10:22.98,CHS,114,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 别忘了蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.15,0:10:24.18,CHS,115,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:26.32,CHS,116,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我做裤子 松饼匠
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:29.36,CHS,117,0,0,0,,我梦寐以求的牛仔裤 呀哈! 动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.91,CHS,118,0,0,0,,- 史莱克先生 - 你好啊 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.74,CHS,119,0,0,0,,你的蛋糕 看!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:37.24,CHS,120,0,0,0,,- 那是什么鬼东西 - 这是绿怪大蛋糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.42,0:10:39.79,CHS,121,0,0,0,,是不是很可爱 多像你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.96,0:10:42.20,CHS,122,0,0,0,,高兴点 这是派对 史莱克 开心点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:43.96,CHS,123,0,0,0,,事实上我心情很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:47.00,CHS,124,0,0,0,,- 噢 我要舔舔那个彩虹 - 驴子!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:48.34,CHS,125,0,0,0,,既然你没什么事做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:49.97,CHS,126,0,0,0,,不如来个出名的史莱克咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:52.68,CHS,127,0,0,0,,- 快咆哮 - 让我明白地告诉你 黄油裤小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.85,0:10:55.39,CHS,128,0,0,0,,绿怪只有发怒时才咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.56,0:10:57.64,CHS,129,0,0,0,,你不会想看到我发怒的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:59.09,CHS,130,0,0,0,,那就怒一个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:02.40,CHS,131,0,0,0,,忍住 忍住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:04.64,CHS,132,0,0,0,,爸爸 他要走了 做点什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.82,0:11:06.10,CHS,133,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.78,CHS,134,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕怎么回事 - 相信我 这样还好一点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.95,0:11:11.53,CHS,135,0,0,0,,- 你舔了它 - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.70,0:11:14.57,CHS,136,0,0,0,,你是个绿怪不代表你要像绿怪那样吃东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.75,0:11:17.03,CHS,137,0,0,0,,你似乎忘记了蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:19.45,CHS,138,0,0,0,,好吧 看着蛋糕 我去拿蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.63,0:11:20.91,CHS,139,0,0,0,,看着蛋糕?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.70,CHS,140,0,0,0,,- 蛋糕呢?! - 我们吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:24.96,CHS,141,0,0,0,,- 对 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:26.38,CHS,142,0,0,0,,不 别哭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:29.04,CHS,143,0,0,0,,嘿 你好像答应我儿子要咆哮的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.63,CHS,144,0,0,0,,- 快咆哮 - 咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:33.09,CHS,145,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢 - 小猪们 我们要再找块蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:36.10,CHS,146,0,0,0,,- 我们把蛋糕都吃光了 - 咆哮 哥们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.27,0:11:38.67,CHS,147,0,0,0,,大家注意 史莱克要表演他拿手的绿怪咆哮了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.85,0:11:41.56,CHS,148,0,0,0,,不是现在 驴子 小猪们 还有没有纸杯蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:43.60,CHS,149,0,0,0,,- 我们也吃完了 - 还剩棒棒糖
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:44.94,CHS,150,0,0,0,,不 我吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:47.81,CHS,151,0,0,0,,- 你没分给我们? - 你也没分羊角面包!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:50.99,CHS,152,0,0,0,,- 一切都会没事的 - 史莱克 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.16,0:11:53.11,CHS,153,0,0,0,,- 来吧 史莱克 你的粉丝都等着呢 - 快咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.91,0:11:56.57,CHS,154,0,0,0,,我们需要蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.91,0:12:00.24,CHS,155,0,0,0,,蛋糕! 蛋糕! 蛋糕!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.31,0:12:16.39,CHS,156,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.56,0:12:19.26,CHS,157,0,0,0,,大家注意 我刚找到了个蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.64,CHS,158,0,0,0,,史莱克 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:53.59,CHS,159,0,0,0,,- 难以置信 - 你来说说看 那些村民...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:57.09,CHS,160,0,0,0,,我不要说什么村民 史莱克 我要说的是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.26,CHS,161,0,0,0,,你就打算这样来纪念孩子们的第一个生日吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:04.43,CHS,162,0,0,0,,- 好吧 所以这都是我的错? - 是的 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.64,CHS,163,0,0,0,,派对之后再说吧 回家再说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:09.52,CHS,164,0,0,0,,你是说那个路边的旅游景点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:14.19,CHS,165,0,0,0,,快来看 跳舞的绿怪! 别担心 他不咬人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.36,0:13:18.53,CHS,166,0,0,0,,我曾经是个绿怪 而现在我只是个绿色小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.70,0:13:23.00,CHS,167,0,0,0,,好吧 也许你不是曾经的那个绿怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:24.87,CHS,168,0,0,0,,但那也许不是什么坏事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:28.71,CHS,169,0,0,0,,我不期望你能理解 你又不是真正的绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:31.17,CHS,170,0,0,0,,你一半的人生都是在宫殿里度过的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:33.88,CHS,171,0,0,0,,另一半被锁在高塔里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:39.34,CHS,172,0,0,0,,听着 我想要的是一切都变回原来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:44.26,CHS,173,0,0,0,,回到村民们都怕我 而我也可以在泥潭里好好洗澡的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:48.02,CHS,174,0,0,0,,回到我想做什么就可以做什么的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:51.56,CHS,175,0,0,0,,回到这世界还有意义的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:54.40,CHS,176,0,0,0,,你是指回到你把我 从火龙看守的高塔中救出来之前?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:55.95,CHS,177,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:06.03,CHS,178,0,0,0,,史莱克 你有三个漂亮的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:08.37,CHS,179,0,0,0,,一个爱你的妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:12.59,CHS,180,0,0,0,,喜欢你的朋友们 你拥有一切
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:19.43,CHS,181,0,0,0,,为什么你是唯一一个看不到这点的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:41.90,CHS,182,0,0,0,,那可真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:52.50,CHS,183,0,0,0,,如果她觉得我会溜回派对道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:55.75,CHS,184,0,0,0,,她就别指望了 又不是什么都要听她的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.92,0:14:59.75,CHS,185,0,0,0,,我是个绿怪 而我不会因为 像绿怪一样举止而道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.93,0:15:04.26,CHS,186,0,0,0,,救命 有人吗 谁来救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:06.18,CHS,187,0,0,0,,拜托 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.22,CHS,188,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.60,0:15:10.39,CHS,189,0,0,0,,我卡住了 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.39,CHS,190,0,0,0,,噢 救救我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.57,0:15:15.35,CHS,191,0,0,0,,有没有人 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:19.03,CHS,192,0,0,0,,痛死我了 我都能看到天堂口的亮光了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:21.65,CHS,193,0,0,0,,祖母 是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.82,0:15:23.20,CHS,194,0,0,0,,对 是我 奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.37,0:15:26.95,CHS,195,0,0,0,,绿怪 求你了 绿怪先生 别吃我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:28.66,CHS,196,0,0,0,,我不会吃了你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.83,0:15:32.12,CHS,197,0,0,0,,但你是个绿怪啊 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.29,0:15:35.13,CHS,198,0,0,0,,对 我...我曾经是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.70,CHS,199,0,0,0,,听着 出来或者被压死
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.87,CHS,200,0,0,0,,所以你不会吃我咯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:44.88,CHS,201,0,0,0,,不 谢谢 我早餐吃了一大碗卷脚趾样的怪东西
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.31,0:15:49.22,CHS,202,0,0,0,,等一下 干嘛这么急 你要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.39,0:15:50.42,CHS,203,0,0,0,,哪也不去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.60,0:15:53.27,CHS,204,0,0,0,,太巧了 我刚好也要走这边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:57.94,CHS,205,0,0,0,,说真的 我顺路带你一程吧 我坚持这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.11,0:16:02.49,CHS,206,0,0,0,,来吧 你帮了我 这是我唯一能做的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.57,CHS,207,0,0,0,,我可以做好吃的老鼠哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:11.20,CHS,208,0,0,0,,好了 你会对泥沼感兴趣吗 懒洋洋的 舒服的泥潭浴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.37,0:16:14.33,CHS,209,0,0,0,,放松一下 舒缓沮丧的情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:18.79,CHS,210,0,0,0,,- 眼球马蒂尼? - 好吧 我只能喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.72,0:16:23.71,CHS,211,0,0,0,,半人马说 "这不是我想说的"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:27.47,CHS,212,0,0,0,,我必须承认 史莱克 我很嫉妒你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.64,0:16:30.97,CHS,213,0,0,0,,过一个绿怪的生活 没有忧虑 没有责任
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.89,CHS,214,0,0,0,,你可以随心所欲地掠夺和统治
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:37.35,CHS,215,0,0,0,,- 随心所欲? 天大的玩笑 - 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:43.10,CHS,216,0,0,0,,有时我希望哪怕有一天 可以重新做回个真正的绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.28,0:16:44.39,CHS,217,0,0,0,,你怎么不早说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.57,0:16:47.74,CHS,218,0,0,0,,魔法交易可是我的专长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.91,0:16:51.61,CHS,219,0,0,0,,真不错 除了哑剧演员 我最喜欢的就是魔术师了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.58,0:16:54.07,CHS,220,0,0,0,,稍等片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.25,0:16:57.42,CHS,221,0,0,0,,"一个月的国王" "一星期的骑士"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:02.79,CHS,222,0,0,0,,一天的绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.43,0:17:06.47,CHS,223,0,0,0,,考虑一下吧 史莱克 被人恐惧和憎恨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.64,0:17:07.67,CHS,224,0,0,0,,你可以这样咆哮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:11.43,CHS,225,0,0,0,,然后村民们就会像这样 "快跑 是史莱克 好害怕"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.60,0:17:14.97,CHS,226,0,0,0,,就像过去那些美好的日子一样 沼泽地就是你的城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.14,0:17:20.77,CHS,227,0,0,0,,- 当世界都还有意义的时候 - 好吧 有什么条件
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.94,0:17:24.61,CHS,228,0,0,0,,条件? 不 没有条件 真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:26.86,CHS,229,0,0,0,,我是说 就有一点 小小的 小小的代价
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:30.03,CHS,230,0,0,0,,好吧 我就知道 你想要什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.03,CHS,231,0,0,0,,- 一天 - 一天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:33.23,CHS,232,0,0,0,,老鼠烤好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:37.96,CHS,233,0,0,0,,要使魔法生效 你得付出才能得到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:41.04,CHS,234,0,0,0,,就这件事来说 你得贡献出一天来得到一天 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.21,0:17:43.92,CHS,235,0,0,0,,我不能就那么丢下我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:47.76,CHS,236,0,0,0,,那就是最好的部分 史莱克 这是个魔法合约
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.75,CHS,237,0,0,0,,没有人会知道你不在
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:55.72,CHS,238,0,0,0,,然而等到这一天结束 你就会觉得像变了个人似的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:58.68,CHS,239,0,0,0,,我还是有点犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.85,0:18:02.39,CHS,240,0,0,0,,没所谓 别管它了 没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.57,0:18:05.06,CHS,241,0,0,0,,你想要胸肉还是腿肉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:09.32,CHS,242,0,0,0,,那我要贡献出的一天是哪天?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.49,0:18:12.36,CHS,243,0,0,0,,不知道 随便一天 你过去的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.54,0:18:14.94,CHS,244,0,0,0,,你得流感的那天? 你失去宠物的那天?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.12,0:18:17.53,CHS,245,0,0,0,,某个多事的呆子插手他不该管的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.33,CHS,246,0,0,0,,而搅黄了你的生意 毁了你的人生的那天?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:24.46,CHS,247,0,0,0,,只是打个比方
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:26.37,CHS,248,0,0,0,,不如用我遇到驴子的那天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:29.04,CHS,249,0,0,0,,那会是我想收回的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:31.22,CHS,250,0,0,0,,我不知道你说的是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:34.63,CHS,251,0,0,0,,我知道了 不如用你都不记得的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:37.01,CHS,252,0,0,0,,比如你还是个婴儿时的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.18,0:18:42.43,CHS,253,0,0,0,,- 一个无辜天真的小宝贝 - 那些日子你想拿就拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:46.98,CHS,254,0,0,0,,- 我才不管你拿走哪一天呢 - 唯有一天你会介意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.36,0:18:51.03,CHS,255,0,0,0,,很好 你童年的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:54.82,CHS,256,0,0,0,,想要一点属于自己的时间总没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.54,CHS,257,0,0,0,,仅仅是短短的24小时而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.78,CHS,258,0,0,0,,- 我还是原来那个绿怪 - 对 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.20,CHS,259,0,0,0,,我以前从不用请求任何人批准
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.04,CHS,260,0,0,0,,所以现在干嘛要请求呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.72,0:19:14.18,CHS,261,0,0,0,,来吧 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:15.89,CHS,262,0,0,0,,签吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.97,0:19:18.43,CHS,263,0,0,0,,继续 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.56,0:19:21.10,CHS,264,0,0,0,,签吧 史莱克 签下你的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.06,0:19:24.09,CHS,265,0,0,0,,噢 你签了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.06,CHS,266,0,0,0,,告诉我 会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.23,0:19:28.89,CHS,267,0,0,0,,玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.29,CHS,268,0,0,0,,我觉得我摔在钥匙上了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.74,CHS,269,0,0,0,,那只鞋里有40个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.68,0:19:53.75,CHS,270,0,0,0,,所以黄鼠狼才这么猖獗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:54.96,CHS,271,0,0,0,,噢 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:57.63,CHS,272,0,0,0,,我们马上就要过河 然后穿过森林...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:19:58.84,CHS,273,0,0,0,,绿怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:23.82,CHS,274,0,0,0,,杀了绿怪! 杀了绿怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:20.46,CHS,275,0,0,0,,这个时候你们该逃跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.53,CHS,276,0,0,0,,再次被通缉的感觉真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.87,0:21:47.37,CHS,277,0,0,0,,这张不错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:57.42,CHS,278,0,0,0,,菲奥娜?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:09.10,CHS,279,0,0,0,,噢 不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.08,0:22:24.73,CHS,280,0,0,0,,我的家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:27.41,CHS,281,0,0,0,,菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:32.42,CHS,282,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 你在里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.12,0:23:12.28,CHS,283,0,0,0,,好了 烂皮儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.96,0:23:15.45,CHS,284,0,0,0,,这不是交易的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.80,0:23:20.29,CHS,285,0,0,0,,烂皮儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.69,0:23:43.73,CHS,286,0,0,0,,绿怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.82,0:23:48.16,CHS,287,0,0,0,,我们又找到一个 姑娘们 抓住他
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.70,0:23:51.36,CHS,288,0,0,0,,你们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:53.53,CHS,289,0,0,0,,你们在我的沼泽地干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:02.00,CHS,290,0,0,0,,看起来有点棘手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:15.84,CHS,291,0,0,0,,扯!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.06,0:24:20.19,CHS,292,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:32.03,CHS,293,0,0,0,,你们这些女巫正在犯大错 我知道我有什么权利
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:34.82,CHS,294,0,0,0,,你有闭嘴的权利
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.39,0:24:57.89,CHS,295,0,0,0,,驴子 能不能别唱了?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.73,0:25:00.06,CHS,296,0,0,0,,驴子!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.41,0:25:11.90,CHS,297,0,0,0,,驴子 我在哪 发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.08,0:25:15.24,CHS,298,0,0,0,,安静点 噢 我讨厌这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:24.75,CHS,299,0,0,0,,我是驾车的 所以我来管音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:28.76,CHS,300,0,0,0,,你们这些女巫能不能想好了再让我唱
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:41.14,CHS,301,0,0,0,,驴子 这是怎么回事 你知道菲奥娜在哪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.77,0:25:44.48,CHS,302,0,0,0,,安静点 绿怪 别给我找麻烦 我需要这份工作
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.65,0:25:46.31,CHS,303,0,0,0,,我才不要回去给老麦唐纳打工
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.48,0:25:49.27,CHS,304,0,0,0,,别跟我唱"咿呀咿呀哦" "咿呀咿呀不"这才是我要说的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.45,0:25:53.15,CHS,305,0,0,0,,我的孩子们都在哪 你老婆火龙呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.32,0:25:56.16,CHS,306,0,0,0,,听着 我觉得你把我和别的会说话的驴搞混了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.33,0:25:57.70,CHS,307,0,0,0,,我以前从来没见过你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.87,0:26:00.44,CHS,308,0,0,0,,从没见过我? 拜托 驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.62,0:26:02.78,CHS,309,0,0,0,,说起来你是怎么知道我名字的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:05.83,CHS,310,0,0,0,,是我啊 史莱克 你最好的朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.50,0:26:07.91,CHS,311,0,0,0,,驴子和绿怪是朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.09,0:26:10.33,CHS,312,0,0,0,,这是我听过的最荒谬的事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.18,0:26:15.67,CHS,313,0,0,0,,那你起码能不能告诉我她们要把我带哪儿去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.85,0:26:19.01,CHS,314,0,0,0,,去她们带每一个绿怪去的地方 去见烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.81,0:26:22.89,CHS,315,0,0,0,,- 踩高跷皮儿! - 我说了安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.32,0:26:33.02,CHS,316,0,0,0,,噢 不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:47.00,CHS,317,0,0,0,,来赌博啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.17,0:26:51.50,CHS,318,0,0,0,,买定离手 买定离手 马上就开始
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.67,0:26:52.71,CHS,319,0,0,0,,耶!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.85,0:26:57.22,CHS,320,0,0,0,,姜饼人?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:03.01,CHS,321,0,0,0,,姜饼人致命一击!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.60,0:27:06.64,CHS,322,0,0,0,,又一个绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.81,0:27:08.52,CHS,323,0,0,0,,恶心 肮脏的绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:10.44,CHS,324,0,0,0,,邪恶的怪物!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.61,0:27:12.23,CHS,325,0,0,0,,肮脏的生物!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.40,0:27:14.69,CHS,326,0,0,0,,令人作呕!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:42.47,CHS,327,0,0,0,,快推!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.57,0:28:02.33,CHS,328,0,0,0,,别担心 驴子 我会把我们救出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.49,0:28:05.66,CHS,329,0,0,0,,好啊 拯救我吧 疯子队长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.78,0:28:44.61,CHS,330,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:48.79,CHS,331,0,0,0,,你又有个客户
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.17,0:28:51.66,CHS,332,0,0,0,,- 狼外婆 - 是 踩高跷皮儿先生
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.84,0:28:53.66,CHS,333,0,0,0,,把我的生意假发拿来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.84,0:28:56.04,CHS,334,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿先生 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.97,0:29:01.42,CHS,335,0,0,0,,- 好了 说吧 - 请把我变成个真正的男孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:04.96,CHS,336,0,0,0,,走开 细节都在条款里 木头男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.14,0:29:07.89,CHS,337,0,0,0,,再见 白蚁们! 你好 粉刺!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:09.80,CHS,338,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:12.27,CHS,339,0,0,0,,史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.23,0:29:15.69,CHS,340,0,0,0,,你来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.69,0:29:18.10,CHS,341,0,0,0,,就差一点
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.86,0:29:21.81,CHS,342,0,0,0,,我等你等得花儿都谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.70,0:29:28.74,CHS,343,0,0,0,,女士们 这就是使这一切成为可能的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.83,0:29:32.37,CHS,344,0,0,0,,来说说看 这一天怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.54,0:29:35.66,CHS,345,0,0,0,,好了 烂皮儿 发生了什么 你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:39.00,CHS,346,0,0,0,,不 史莱克 不是我做了什么 而是你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.17,0:29:42.96,CHS,347,0,0,0,,多亏了你 国王和王后把王国转让给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.14,0:29:44.55,CHS,348,0,0,0,,他们绝不会那样做
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.72,0:29:49.35,CHS,349,0,0,0,,他们会的 只要我承诺他们的问题都会化为乌有
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.85,0:29:53.18,CHS,350,0,0,0,,然后他们 化为乌有了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.53,0:30:03.91,CHS,351,0,0,0,,他们会做任何事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.07,0:30:06.20,CHS,352,0,0,0,,只要是他们觉得能解除他们女儿诅咒的事
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:08.74,CHS,353,0,0,0,,是我解除了菲奥娜的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.91,0:30:12.24,CHS,354,0,0,0,,如果你从来不存在 怎么去解除诅咒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.41,0:30:15.41,CHS,355,0,0,0,,你最好把话给我说清楚 肮脏的小人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:17.87,CHS,356,0,0,0,,来 让我一字一句跟你说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:22.37,CHS,357,0,0,0,,你给了我你过去的一天 连你都不记得的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.55,0:30:26.76,CHS,358,0,0,0,,当你还是个无辜天真的小宝贝时的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.39,0:30:31.97,CHS,359,0,0,0,,你把我出生那天拿走了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.14,0:30:35.14,CHS,360,0,0,0,,不 史莱克 是你给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.31,0:30:38.85,CHS,361,0,0,0,,趁还能享受尽情享受这一切吧.踩高跷皮儿.因为这天马上就过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.02,0:30:41.73,CHS,362,0,0,0,,不过你还没听到最精彩的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.90,0:30:47.61,CHS,363,0,0,0,,既然你从来没出生过 当这一天结束 你也会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.66,0:30:53.29,CHS,364,0,0,0,,菲奥娜在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.00,0:30:55.20,CHS,365,0,0,0,,我的家人在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.37,0:30:58.58,CHS,366,0,0,0,,愚蠢的小绿怪 你还没听明白吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:01.29,CHS,367,0,0,0,,你看 你从没出生过
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:03.59,CHS,368,0,0,0,,你从没遇到过菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.76,0:31:07.34,CHS,369,0,0,0,,你们的孩子不存在
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.22,0:31:13.43,CHS,370,0,0,0,,这是个多哲学的悖论啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.27,0:31:17.68,CHS,371,0,0,0,,看起来你刚好得到了你想要的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.69,0:31:21.94,CHS,372,0,0,0,,- 祝你绿怪日快乐 - 烂皮儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.94,0:31:25.22,CHS,373,0,0,0,,抓住他 女巫们
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:39.00,CHS,374,0,0,0,,你知道什么能振奋人心吗 周五踢踏舞之夜
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.17,0:31:41.84,CHS,375,0,0,0,,漫不经心地舞动 放松你的脚趾
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.84,0:31:50.50,CHS,376,0,0,0,,上 姑娘们
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.15,0:32:04.85,CHS,377,0,0,0,,把所有的门锁起来 你们这些没用的女巫 快去!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.65,0:32:09.28,CHS,378,0,0,0,,马上回来 驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.45,0:32:12.86,CHS,379,0,0,0,,我不认识你 我不认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.35,0:32:34.34,CHS,380,0,0,0,,我很庆幸我不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.02,0:32:40.35,CHS,381,0,0,0,,救救我 救命
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.56,0:32:42.59,CHS,382,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.03,0:32:52.57,CHS,383,0,0,0,,不 我漂亮的球球!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.04,0:32:58.86,CHS,384,0,0,0,,小心!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:12.04,CHS,385,0,0,0,,狼外婆?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.22,0:33:14.54,CHS,386,0,0,0,,拿我的怒火假发来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:26.56,CHS,387,0,0,0,,救命啊 我被一个精神错乱的绿怪绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.73,0:33:28.14,CHS,388,0,0,0,,驴子 别蹬我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.32,0:33:31.23,CHS,389,0,0,0,,当心点你的蹄子
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.29,0:33:39.91,CHS,390,0,0,0,,- 把我钱包拿走吧 - 嘿
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:42.07,CHS,391,0,0,0,,我他妈被绑架了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.71,0:33:43.87,CHS,392,0,0,0,,可怕的怪物 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.04,0:33:46.12,CHS,393,0,0,0,,你冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.29,0:33:47.46,CHS,394,0,0,0,,我是你的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:50.29,CHS,395,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你的 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.26,0:33:53.13,CHS,396,0,0,0,,好吧 那我现在...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.30,0:33:55.76,CHS,397,0,0,0,,...放手
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.46,CHS,398,0,0,0,,求求你 最后吃我的脸 把我的蹄子寄给我妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.64,0:34:01.09,CHS,399,0,0,0,,驴子 相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.27,0:34:03.84,CHS,400,0,0,0,,- 我凭什么相信你 - 因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.02,0:34:06.10,CHS,401,0,0,0,,因为...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.78,0:34:11.10,CHS,402,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.63,0:34:19.83,CHS,403,0,0,0,,∮ 不论春夏秋冬 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:22.83,CHS,404,0,0,0,,∮ 你只需叫我一声 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.93,0:34:25.83,CHS,405,0,0,0,,∮ 我就会在你身边 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.93,0:34:32.83,CHS,406,0,0,0,,∮ 我是你的朋友 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.94,0:34:53.18,CHS,407,0,0,0,,好吧 跑吧 有多远滚多远 谁要你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.73,0:35:29.40,CHS,408,0,0,0,,我从没看过绿怪哭泣
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.90,0:35:36.61,CHS,409,0,0,0,,我没在哭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.78,0:35:38.82,CHS,410,0,0,0,,没什么好害羞的 我还整天哭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.99,0:35:41.91,CHS,411,0,0,0,,只要想起我的祖母 或者是小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.07,0:35:46.40,CHS,412,0,0,0,,或者我祖母亲吻小猫咪 或者小小猫咪祖母
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:50.70,CHS,413,0,0,0,,- 见鬼 这真悲催 - 我说了我没哭
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.88,0:35:52.75,CHS,414,0,0,0,,放松点 我只是想帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:54.74,CHS,415,0,0,0,,你干嘛不高兴又不关我的事
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.75,0:35:57.08,CHS,416,0,0,0,,说起来 你干嘛不高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.26,0:36:00.13,CHS,417,0,0,0,,我被骗签了不该签的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.30,0:36:02.59,CHS,418,0,0,0,,你不会是签了做苦力的卖身契吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.76,0:36:05.43,CHS,419,0,0,0,,不 我签的是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.10,0:36:08.59,CHS,420,0,0,0,,你永远不该和烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿签合约!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:10.10,CHS,421,0,0,0,,对 我现在明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.27,0:36:12.26,CHS,422,0,0,0,,- 他精美的印刷下隐藏着狡诈 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.44,0:36:14.76,CHS,423,0,0,0,,- 他的解约条款很隐蔽 - 对 我知...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.61,0:36:18.06,CHS,424,0,0,0,,- 你刚说什么 - 我在说解约条款
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.24,0:36:19.40,CHS,425,0,0,0,,以前是你得猜出他的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.57,0:36:21.48,CHS,426,0,0,0,,但现在所有人都知道烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿是谁了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.66,0:36:23.28,CHS,427,0,0,0,,驴子 我已经仔细看过合约了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.45,0:36:25.77,CHS,428,0,0,0,,完全没提到有解约条款啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.95,0:36:27.86,CHS,429,0,0,0,,你不能期待他会让你轻易找到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.04,0:36:30.28,CHS,430,0,0,0,,来 让我告诉你怎么找
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.46,0:36:31.95,CHS,431,0,0,0,,我每天跟女巫们厮混
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.12,0:36:33.78,CHS,432,0,0,0,,可不是无所事事的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.96,0:36:36.17,CHS,433,0,0,0,,你的小容量绿怪脑瓜是不可能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.34,0:36:38.62,CHS,434,0,0,0,,我折多边形的复杂技巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.80,0:36:40.04,CHS,435,0,0,0,,你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.22,0:36:43.30,CHS,436,0,0,0,,嘿 你不离远点我没法折纸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.47,0:36:46.75,CHS,437,0,0,0,,谢谢 好了 这就是要做的 把这边折起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.93,0:36:49.30,CHS,438,0,0,0,,让这个字母放到这 把这个角折上来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.47,0:36:53.64,CHS,439,0,0,0,,如果你折对了 它就会告诉你怎么做 看!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.81,0:36:56.14,CHS,440,0,0,0,,"试试露的幸福"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.15,0:37:00.18,CHS,441,0,0,0,,露是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.36,0:37:02.15,CHS,442,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.49,0:37:09.53,CHS,443,0,0,0,,"真爱之吻"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.83,0:37:14.32,CHS,444,0,0,0,,你得先请我吃晚饭
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.17,0:37:18.33,CHS,445,0,0,0,,"根据精灵法则 如果对此不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.50,0:37:22.00,CHS,446,0,0,0,,真爱之吻会使这合约无效"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.17,0:37:25.67,CHS,447,0,0,0,,驴子 你做到了 看看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.84,0:37:30.64,CHS,448,0,0,0,,如果菲奥娜和我交换真爱之吻 我就可以重新回到我的生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.81,0:37:33.72,CHS,449,0,0,0,,好了 这又不是宠物乐园 那这个菲奥娜在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.35,0:37:36.81,CHS,450,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.48,0:37:38.86,CHS,451,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.02,0:37:41.18,CHS,452,0,0,0,,我丢了什么东西的话 就会沿着脚印一路找回去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.36,0:37:43.68,CHS,453,0,0,0,,所以...你最后一次见她是什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.36,0:37:46.52,CHS,454,0,0,0,,我最后一次见到她时
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.70,0:37:49.37,CHS,455,0,0,0,,我跟她说我希望从来没救过她
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.37,0:37:54.49,CHS,456,0,0,0,,- 噢 不 - 史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:57.24,CHS,457,0,0,0,,史莱克! 史莱克 等等! 等等 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:37:59.54,CHS,458,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 这是火龙看守的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.71,0:38:01.62,CHS,459,0,0,0,,里面有火龙
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.51,0:38:04.92,CHS,460,0,0,0,,好吧 你就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.09,0:38:08.01,CHS,461,0,0,0,,我就在这等着 给咱俩找点早餐
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.81,0:38:20.06,CHS,462,0,0,0,,菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.27,0:38:56.93,CHS,463,0,0,0,,噢 不
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.86,0:39:10.15,CHS,464,0,0,0,,如果我没救菲奥娜...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:14.82,CHS,465,0,0,0,,...那会是谁救的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.38,0:39:30.17,CHS,466,0,0,0,,这本该是我们相遇那天菲奥娜给我的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:33.84,CHS,467,0,0,0,,是我们爱的象征
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.68,0:39:35.79,CHS,468,0,0,0,,快闻闻
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.97,0:39:37.85,CHS,469,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们 把那脏礼物从我面前拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.02,0:39:41.55,CHS,470,0,0,0,,你的鼻子是找到我妻子的唯一机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.73,0:39:44.30,CHS,471,0,0,0,,所以别抱怨 闻闻看
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.48,0:39:45.94,CHS,472,0,0,0,,闻一下 快闻 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.11,0:39:47.82,CHS,473,0,0,0,,我看起来像只猎犬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.99,0:39:50.39,CHS,474,0,0,0,,如果你没看清楚的话 现在告诉你 我是只驴子 不是狗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.57,0:39:53.32,CHS,475,0,0,0,,如果我是只狗 他们就会叫我狗 而不是驴子!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.49,0:39:54.87,CHS,476,0,0,0,,而且还有件事...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:57.33,CHS,477,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.99,0:39:59.40,CHS,478,0,0,0,,我好像闻到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.04,0:40:02.33,CHS,479,0,0,0,,- 不管是什么 闻起来很香 - 菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.50,0:40:04.12,CHS,480,0,0,0,,香甜可口的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.83,CHS,481,0,0,0,,嘿 那可是我老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.42,0:40:09.50,CHS,482,0,0,0,,驴子!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.51,0:40:15.59,CHS,483,0,0,0,,耶! 华夫饼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.76,0:40:18.72,CHS,484,0,0,0,,我还以为华夫饼仙女只是睡前故事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.27,0:40:22.85,CHS,485,0,0,0,,层层酥脆金黄 刷着糖浆的美味!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.02,0:40:25.18,CHS,486,0,0,0,,驴子 别吃
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.36,0:40:29.48,CHS,487,0,0,0,,树林中间摆着一摞刚出炉的华夫饼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.65,0:40:31.52,CHS,488,0,0,0,,你不觉得这有点可疑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.28,0:40:34.44,CHS,489,0,0,0,,噢 你... 我只是... 你要...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.61,0:40:36.57,CHS,490,0,0,0,,这样不好 驴子 不许
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.74,0:40:40.79,CHS,491,0,0,0,,我说不 别吃 离开它
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.70,0:40:42.74,CHS,492,0,0,0,,你还是吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.88,0:40:50.99,CHS,493,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.09,0:40:55.12,CHS,494,0,0,0,,驴子!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.30,0:40:57.71,CHS,495,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.89,0:41:00.97,CHS,496,0,0,0,,驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.48,0:41:05.05,CHS,497,0,0,0,,救命 救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.23,0:41:07.98,CHS,498,0,0,0,,救命 史莱克 救命!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.75,0:41:32.95,CHS,499,0,0,0,,小心头
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.17,0:41:34.50,CHS,500,0,0,0,,嘿 有个新来的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.67,0:41:36.80,CHS,501,0,0,0,,.看看他 穿着周日小背心
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.97,0:41:38.71,CHS,502,0,0,0,,他长得真瘦小 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.89,0:41:40.96,CHS,503,0,0,0,,对 感谢命运之神给我们送来了个亲密的战友
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.14,0:41:42.76,CHS,504,0,0,0,,给他穿上装备
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.93,0:41:44.89,CHS,505,0,0,0,,- 走吧 哥们 - 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.86,0:41:51.68,CHS,506,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.99,0:41:59.77,CHS,507,0,0,0,,- 欢迎加入反抗军 - 反抗军?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.95,0:42:03.53,CHS,508,0,0,0,,我们为了自由 为了所有的绿怪而战!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.00,0:42:14.63,CHS,509,0,0,0,,我从不知道我们还会这招
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.80,0:42:17.29,CHS,510,0,0,0,,救命 别吃我 我长了疥癣的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.47,0:42:21.93,CHS,511,0,0,0,,- 我有毒 我... - 让我来 这个我最拿手了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.10,0:42:24.50,CHS,512,0,0,0,,喂  我还没把他剖肠挂肚清干净呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.68,0:42:26.84,CHS,513,0,0,0,,相信我 这不合你口味
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.02,0:42:29.06,CHS,514,0,0,0,,我会平静地进去 奋战着出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.23,0:42:31.30,CHS,515,0,0,0,,- 放手 - 别让老娘发火
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.48,0:42:32.56,CHS,516,0,0,0,,你的晚餐是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.73,0:42:34.85,CHS,517,0,0,0,,- 别吵了 伙计们 - 我得先把内脏去了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.03,0:42:37.02,CHS,518,0,0,0,,- 她回来了 - 她来了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.88,0:42:55.96,CHS,519,0,0,0,,菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.09,0:43:00.17,CHS,520,0,0,0,,我好高兴终于找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.35,0:43:09.73,CHS,521,0,0,0,,也许你是跑错了方向
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.89,0:43:13.39,CHS,522,0,0,0,,不过还是提醒你一句 私人空间对我来说很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.69,0:43:16.52,CHS,523,0,0,0,,你不知道我是谁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.69,0:43:18.19,CHS,524,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.36,0:43:20.35,CHS,525,0,0,0,,布洛根 我有远得要命王国的最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.53,0:43:22.69,CHS,526,0,0,0,,把大家召集起来 到军事室开会
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.86,0:43:25.36,CHS,527,0,0,0,,格雷琴 确保人员物资今晚前能准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.53,0:43:27.49,CHS,528,0,0,0,,- 我要和你谈谈 - 你到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:32.20,CHS,529,0,0,0,,好吧 我知道你不记得我了 不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.37,0:43:34.45,CHS,530,0,0,0,,我们是夫妻 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.63,0:43:37.38,CHS,531,0,0,0,,在生日会上 有几只小猪还有木偶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.55,0:43:38.96,CHS,532,0,0,0,,村民们想让我在他们的杈子上签名
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.13,0:43:41.17,CHS,533,0,0,0,,还有个小男孩不停说 "快咆哮"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.34,0:43:43.75,CHS,534,0,0,0,,然后我砸了小猪们偷吃的蛋糕 然后等我醒了之后
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.93,0:43:46.25,CHS,535,0,0,0,,我的驴子就掉进了你的华夫饼陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.81,0:43:51.30,CHS,536,0,0,0,,明白了吧 有人听懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.06,0:43:55.68,CHS,537,0,0,0,,我想我刚刚应该踢重一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.86,0:43:58.06,CHS,538,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 我必须...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.57,0:44:02.06,CHS,539,0,0,0,,女巫! 好了 所有人 你们知道我们怎么演练的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.24,0:44:04.06,CHS,540,0,0,0,,- 菲奥娜 - 女巫 噢 不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.24,0:44:06.31,CHS,541,0,0,0,,- 女巫 女巫 - 过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.23,0:44:38.01,CHS,542,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 这是今天第三次巡逻了 我们不能躲一辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.19,0:44:41.77,CHS,543,0,0,0,,相信我 布洛根 今晚之后我们就不用躲了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.36,0:44:46.53,CHS,544,0,0,0,,- 那是你老婆? - 那是我老婆
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.95,0:44:49.98,CHS,545,0,0,0,,我能想象出在你们家谁是老大了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.16,0:44:58.16,CHS,546,0,0,0,,有些人喜欢称酒杯空了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.33,0:45:02.33,CHS,547,0,0,0,,而我则喜欢说它满了一半
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.17,0:45:06.29,CHS,548,0,0,0,,我们虽然有等级高低之分 女士们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.47,0:45:09.59,CHS,549,0,0,0,,但我们不仅是一个王国
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.14,0:45:11.38,CHS,550,0,0,0,,我们是一家人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.39,0:45:16.09,CHS,551,0,0,0,,每个人都有纸杯蛋糕了吗 蛋糕 蛋糕 很好 你有了吗 芭芭?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.27,0:45:17.30,CHS,552,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.48,0:45:20.68,CHS,553,0,0,0,,是的 我们抓到了不少绿怪
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.86,0:45:25.02,CHS,554,0,0,0,,只是有一个跑了 不过谁在乎呢 又不是什么大事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.53,0:45:27.60,CHS,555,0,0,0,,我反正无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.78,0:45:30.53,CHS,556,0,0,0,,又不是世界末日
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.70,0:45:34.62,CHS,557,0,0,0,,除了... 一些有趣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.79,0:45:38.29,CHS,558,0,0,0,,我想到逃跑的那个绿怪是史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:41.29,CHS,559,0,0,0,,如果他在日出前吻了菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.46,0:45:44.63,CHS,560,0,0,0,,那就是世界末日 我们的世界末日!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.80,0:45:46.67,CHS,561,0,0,0,,我王国的末日!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.22,0:45:52.67,CHS,562,0,0,0,,不过 正如我所说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.85,0:45:56.89,CHS,563,0,0,0,,我总是乐观地看待一切
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.35,0:46:00.34,CHS,564,0,0,0,,大喊大叫让我口干舌燥
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.52,0:46:04.35,CHS,565,0,0,0,,有人想来点吗 润润喉
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.52,0:46:07.39,CHS,566,0,0,0,,晶莹剔透的玻璃杯里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.57,0:46:10.74,CHS,567,0,0,0,,斟满甘甜的泉水?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.91,0:46:13.23,CHS,568,0,0,0,,有人口渴吗 没人口渴? 没人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.24,0:46:16.23,CHS,569,0,0,0,,好吧 那有人愿意告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.41,0:46:19.03,CHS,570,0,0,0,,抓住绿怪需要什么 你说说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.21,0:46:20.32,CHS,571,0,0,0,,更快的扫帚?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:22.08,CHS,572,0,0,0,,- 错 - 更尖的帽子?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.25,0:46:25.75,CHS,573,0,0,0,,- 错 你! - 或许我们可以雇一个职业赏金猎人?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.80,0:46:29.75,CHS,574,0,0,0,,天啊 这是什么世界
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.38,0:46:34.30,CHS,575,0,0,0,,事实上这是个不错的主意 芭芭!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.93,0:46:36.55,CHS,576,0,0,0,,给我去找个赏金猎人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.72,0:46:39.89,CHS,577,0,0,0,,如果音乐能安抚那些凶残的野兽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.06,0:46:43.26,CHS,578,0,0,0,,我想我有个合适的人选
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.61,0:46:49.85,CHS,579,0,0,0,,听好了各位 远得要命王国有消息说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.03,0:46:53.19,CHS,580,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿要亲自指挥今晚的绿怪围捕
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.36,0:46:55.07,CHS,581,0,0,0,,- 他从来没这么做过 - 什么? 为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.24,0:46:57.07,CHS,582,0,0,0,,我打赌是因为我们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.24,0:46:58.99,CHS,583,0,0,0,,如果那个纸杯蛋糕小丑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.16,0:47:02.28,CHS,584,0,0,0,,终于脱离了他那些肮脏女巫的保护
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.96,0:47:04.24,CHS,585,0,0,0,,他一定会很脆弱
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.42,0:47:07.58,CHS,586,0,0,0,,计划很简单 如果他们按照正常的巡逻路线
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.75,0:47:09.88,CHS,587,0,0,0,,就会在午夜的时候到达河边
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.05,0:47:13.55,CHS,588,0,0,0,,我们可以埋伏在路旁 等着他的篷车
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.72,0:47:17.05,CHS,589,0,0,0,,一旦他们到达空地 我就会发出信号
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.22,0:47:19.09,CHS,590,0,0,0,,然后就进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.85,0:47:28.10,CHS,591,0,0,0,,然后等烟雾消散后... 等等 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.27,0:47:29.55,CHS,592,0,0,0,,那是我的烤香肠摊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.65,0:47:32.81,CHS,593,0,0,0,,不 甜饼 我们不需要这个
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:36.69,CHS,594,0,0,0,,相信我 菲奥娜 你们伏击完之后一定会很饿
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.62,0:47:39.41,CHS,595,0,0,0,,继续说你的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.16,0:47:43.61,CHS,596,0,0,0,,好吧 正如我所说 等烟雾散去后
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.79,0:47:47.49,CHS,597,0,0,0,,烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿完蛋了 烤香肠也吃完了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.67,0:47:50.29,CHS,598,0,0,0,,远得要命王国就能重获自由
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.46,0:47:52.21,CHS,599,0,0,0,,- 我们也会获得自由 - 传令下去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.38,0:47:55.63,CHS,600,0,0,0,,烂皮儿一离开宫殿 我们就准备行动
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.97,0:48:00.18,CHS,601,0,0,0,,- 伙计 这下可有大事了 - 告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.35,0:48:02.92,CHS,602,0,0,0,,我该怎么做才能让她在日出前吻我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.10,0:48:04.64,CHS,603,0,0,0,,事实上我在说革命的事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.81,0:48:06.30,CHS,604,0,0,0,,革命?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.39,CHS,605,0,0,0,,为什么你不把跟我说的话跟她说一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.56,0:48:11.19,CHS,606,0,0,0,,关于你是她的真爱 以及你来自另一个时空之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.36,0:48:13.15,CHS,607,0,0,0,,如果我能那么做的话 我为什么不告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.32,0:48:15.31,CHS,608,0,0,0,,你和一只会喷火的龙结婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.49,0:48:18.52,CHS,609,0,0,0,,然后有了小小的变种驴龙杂交宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.03,0:48:20.19,CHS,610,0,0,0,,我真这么做了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.37,0:48:23.28,CHS,611,0,0,0,,你也看到刚刚的事了 她会觉得我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.45,0:48:24.65,CHS,612,0,0,0,,我成爸爸了?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.83,0:48:28.20,CHS,613,0,0,0,,如果我能让菲奥娜亲我一次
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.21,0:48:32.00,CHS,614,0,0,0,,那我肯定能让她再亲第二次
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.88,0:48:35.09,CHS,615,0,0,0,,史莱克 我的宝宝们长的是蹄子还是爪子
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.26,0:48:36.83,CHS,616,0,0,0,,驴子 嘘
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.01,0:48:38.42,CHS,617,0,0,0,,有人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.89,0:48:41.05,CHS,618,0,0,0,,菲奥娜?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.06,0:48:50.14,CHS,619,0,0,0,,先生 你不该出现在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.31,0:48:51.69,CHS,620,0,0,0,,靴猫?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.20,0:48:58.90,CHS,621,0,0,0,,这一定是开玩笑呢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.75,0:49:15.21,CHS,622,0,0,0,,有种 就来喂我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.38,0:49:18.71,CHS,623,0,0,0,,靴猫 你怎么了 你怎么变得这么肥...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.09,0:49:23.09,CHS,624,0,0,0,,- 非常帅... - 我认识你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.26,0:49:25.84,CHS,625,0,0,0,,你的帽子呢 皮带呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.02,0:49:27.76,CHS,626,0,0,0,,你的小靴子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.93,0:49:30.39,CHS,627,0,0,0,,靴子? 猫穿靴子? 哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.56,0:49:33.65,CHS,628,0,0,0,,但你是穿靴子的猫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.27,0:49:35.85,CHS,629,0,0,0,,也许曾经是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.03,0:49:37.57,CHS,630,0,0,0,,但那已经是我不能承受之名了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.74,0:49:39.39,CHS,631,0,0,0,,那可不是你唯一不能承受的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.57,0:49:43.65,CHS,632,0,0,0,,喂 我退休后也许是放纵了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.83,0:49:46.40,CHS,633,0,0,0,,但放下刀剑绝对是我此生最明智的决定
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.58,0:49:49.61,CHS,634,0,0,0,,我可以随心所欲地喝牛奶 抓老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:52.62,CHS,635,0,0,0,,一会儿再抓它
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.79,0:49:55.20,CHS,636,0,0,0,,靴猫 我对你做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.38,0:49:56.84,CHS,637,0,0,0,,你变得软弱不堪的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.63,0:50:01.79,CHS,638,0,0,0,,我一天刷两次毛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.97,0:50:04.59,CHS,639,0,0,0,,听着 现在补救还来得及
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.76,0:50:07.00,CHS,640,0,0,0,,你只需要帮我从菲奥娜那里得到一个吻
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.18,0:50:10.30,CHS,641,0,0,0,,你在干嘛 有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.48,0:50:13.43,CHS,642,0,0,0,,我知道组织一场叛乱有多大的压力
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.60,0:50:15.60,CHS,643,0,0,0,,募集部队 计划进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.77,0:50:19.56,CHS,644,0,0,0,,所以我给你带了点小东西缓解压力
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.11,0:50:21.19,CHS,645,0,0,0,,礼物篮?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.36,0:50:23.98,CHS,646,0,0,0,,不客气 看看都给你准备了什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.16,0:50:26.53,CHS,647,0,0,0,,心形盒子装的肥蛆
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.16,0:50:29.61,CHS,648,0,0,0,,臭鼬味香薰蜡烛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.79,0:50:34.16,CHS,649,0,0,0,,- 不过现在不是时候... - 看这是什么 优惠券!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.33,0:50:36.37,CHS,650,0,0,0,,看看 "专享免费足疗"
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.54,0:50:38.87,CHS,651,0,0,0,,"沼泥美容" 噢 还有这个
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.05,0:50:42.58,CHS,652,0,0,0,,"专享免费香吻" 现在就兑现吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.76,0:50:44.75,CHS,653,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.93,0:50:46.47,CHS,654,0,0,0,,但我正要进行一次革命
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.64,0:50:48.84,CHS,655,0,0,0,,所以除非你能把烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿的人头带来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.01,0:50:51.14,CHS,656,0,0,0,,我建议你还是拿着你的礼物篮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.31,0:50:55.01,CHS,657,0,0,0,,离开我的帐篷 去干点有用的事
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.69,0:50:59.98,CHS,658,0,0,0,,对 你说得对 我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.15,0:51:03.19,CHS,659,0,0,0,,我只是想表示下友好 没什么不好的感觉吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.82,0:51:05.85,CHS,660,0,0,0,,歉意的拥抱?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.07,0:51:08.35,CHS,661,0,0,0,,再来个晚安亲吻
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.87,0:51:10.90,CHS,662,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.50,0:51:13.65,CHS,663,0,0,0,,等等 那个是不是槲寄生
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.37,0:51:18.74,CHS,664,0,0,0,,嘿 史莱克 我的宝宝可爱吗 它们有没有让人觉得不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.92,0:51:22.04,CHS,665,0,0,0,,- 那家伙到底从哪冒出来的 - 是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.21,0:51:26.43,CHS,666,0,0,0,,多年的安逸和娇纵使我软弱了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.59,0:51:29.51,CHS,667,0,0,0,,别傻了 谁是最美的猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:31.22,CHS,668,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.06,0:51:41.60,CHS,669,0,0,0,,爸爸觉得你看起来很美 飞飞
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.90,0:51:43.93,CHS,670,0,0,0,,嘎嘎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.11,0:51:45.69,CHS,671,0,0,0,,好了 小猪们 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.86,0:51:48.07,CHS,672,0,0,0,,别忘了带走她的小夜壶
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.03,0:51:50.99,CHS,673,0,0,0,,小猪只不过想回家而已
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.16,0:51:54.44,CHS,674,0,0,0,,- 踩高跷皮儿先生 他来了 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.22,0:52:11.38,CHS,675,0,0,0,,吹笛人 旅途还愉快吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.47,0:52:14.55,CHS,676,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.72,0:52:16.47,CHS,677,0,0,0,,这人也算个赏金猎人?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.64,0:52:19.51,CHS,678,0,0,0,,他打算怎么做 给那些怪物吹摇篮曲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.49,0:52:33.12,CHS,679,0,0,0,,好了 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.33,0:52:36.45,CHS,680,0,0,0,,停下!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.75,0:52:42.13,CHS,681,0,0,0,,好了 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.46,0:52:49.13,CHS,682,0,0,0,,看来是该给吹笛人赏金的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.30,0:52:54.05,CHS,683,0,0,0,,格里泽达 没听见吗 要给人家赏金了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.22,0:52:57.26,CHS,684,0,0,0,,快去拿我的支票簿 快! 滚开!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.43,0:52:59.43,CHS,685,0,0,0,,你们这些不干事的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.86,0:53:04.68,CHS,686,0,0,0,,给 确保他们都吃光光
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.86,0:53:08.14,CHS,687,0,0,0,,不能空着肚子打仗 去 快去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.32,0:53:09.81,CHS,688,0,0,0,,叮叮
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.58,0:53:20.45,CHS,689,0,0,0,,- 来吧 驴子 - 再来一次吧 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.62,0:53:22.91,CHS,690,0,0,0,,好吧 但这是最后一次
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.46,0:53:25.49,CHS,691,0,0,0,,这就来了 快看他
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.84,0:53:32.67,CHS,692,0,0,0,,我看见你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.60,0:53:41.47,CHS,693,0,0,0,,你这个朋友真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.64,0:53:43.77,CHS,694,0,0,0,,我知道你为啥没把他吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.94,0:53:46.56,CHS,695,0,0,0,,驴子 我不想把你从这群喜欢你的人里拖走
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.73,0:53:49.02,CHS,696,0,0,0,,但我和菲奥娜毫无进展
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.19,0:53:52.28,CHS,697,0,0,0,,- 我需要你的帮助 - 嘿 伙计们 谁要点心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.07,0:53:57.11,CHS,698,0,0,0,,- 你从哪弄来的 - 菲奥娜的垃圾桶里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.28,0:54:00.20,CHS,699,0,0,0,,又是某个纯情单相思小男孩的礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.00,0:54:03.66,CHS,700,0,0,0,,这个很好笑 甜饼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.67,0:54:07.67,CHS,701,0,0,0,,认识菲奥娜的人都知道这种东西对她没用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.84,0:54:09.33,CHS,702,0,0,0,,对我有用
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.51,0:54:12.38,CHS,703,0,0,0,,驴子 我该怎么办 我都不认识她了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.55,0:54:15.92,CHS,704,0,0,0,,你陷入麻烦了 罗密欧 菲奥娜只在乎她的事业
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.09,0:54:19.09,CHS,705,0,0,0,,- 为了事业 - 为了事业
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.27,0:54:22.43,CHS,706,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.87,0:54:45.90,CHS,707,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.92,0:54:52.00,CHS,708,0,0,0,,- 好身手 - 你要干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.17,0:54:54.88,CHS,709,0,0,0,,你以为我要干什么? 我是来为伏击做准备的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.05,0:54:57.72,CHS,710,0,0,0,,我热爱战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.89,0:55:02.05,CHS,711,0,0,0,,行动前要先热热身嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.22,0:55:03.25,CHS,712,0,0,0,,这个有人用了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.43,0:55:05.26,CHS,713,0,0,0,,那是用来刷马桶的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.19,0:55:10.31,CHS,714,0,0,0,,这是我们用来刷马桶刷的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.48,0:55:11.76,CHS,715,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.86,0:55:13.97,CHS,716,0,0,0,,终于拿对了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.13,0:55:33.29,CHS,717,0,0,0,,嘿 呃 斯科特?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.62,CHS,718,0,0,0,,事实上我叫史莱克
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.80,0:55:38.63,CHS,719,0,0,0,,今晚的伏击你会丧命的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:42.42,CHS,720,0,0,0,,我没事的 我能照顾好自己
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.93,0:55:44.17,CHS,721,0,0,0,,那就试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.60,0:55:47.05,CHS,722,0,0,0,,嘿 喂
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.23,0:55:48.26,CHS,723,0,0,0,,怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.98,0:55:54.31,CHS,724,0,0,0,,菲奥娜?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.89,0:56:28.17,CHS,725,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.52,0:56:29.85,CHS,726,0,0,0,,把手伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.19,0:56:33.90,CHS,727,0,0,0,,穿过桥下 绕过火龙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.06,0:56:36.31,CHS,728,0,0,0,,绕过火龙 最后...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.48,0:56:38.06,CHS,729,0,0,0,,抵达城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.70,0:56:48.03,CHS,730,0,0,0,,哇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.75,0:56:51.87,CHS,731,0,0,0,,好吧 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.50,0:56:54.21,CHS,732,0,0,0,,似乎你确实可以照顾好自己
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.38,0:56:56.33,CHS,733,0,0,0,,- 但菲奥娜... - 快去为行动做准备
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.50,0:56:59.50,CHS,734,0,0,0,,- 我会去的 但菲奥娜... - 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.60,0:57:14.02,CHS,735,0,0,0,,好了 削利斧头 准备好武器
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.19,0:57:15.76,CHS,736,0,0,0,,完美的准备是打胜仗的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.94,0:57:21.40,CHS,737,0,0,0,,绿怪 等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.90,0:57:24.44,CHS,738,0,0,0,,绿怪 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.07,0:57:27.35,CHS,739,0,0,0,,给我一分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.53,0:57:30.37,CHS,740,0,0,0,,靴猫 我现在心情不是太好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.54,0:57:33.70,CHS,741,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我刚刚看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.87,0:57:35.53,CHS,742,0,0,0,,刚才在那儿 你和菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.71,0:57:38.38,CHS,743,0,0,0,,她心中有...有火花
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.55,0:57:40.25,CHS,744,0,0,0,,我以为早就熄灭了的火花
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.42,0:57:44.83,CHS,745,0,0,0,,好像 有那么一刻 菲奥娜真的找到了她的真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.01,0:57:48.34,CHS,746,0,0,0,,我就是她的真爱 我解除了她的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.93,0:57:50.76,CHS,747,0,0,0,,你知道她的诅咒?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.93,0:57:54.22,CHS,748,0,0,0,,白昼与黑夜交替更迭
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.39,0:57:57.15,CHS,749,0,0,0,,只有噩梦轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.31,0:58:00.81,CHS,750,0,0,0,,唯有真爱之吻
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.11,0:58:05.98,CHS,751,0,0,0,,才能引向真爱之魂
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.87,0:58:08.74,CHS,752,0,0,0,,这首诗你都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.91,0:58:11.40,CHS,753,0,0,0,,绝对是 你就是真命天子 你要向她证明!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.58,0:58:13.74,CHS,754,0,0,0,,- 怎么证明 - 说服她
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.91,0:58:15.24,CHS,755,0,0,0,,等她一个人的时候去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.42,0:58:19.08,CHS,756,0,0,0,,然后告诉她只有她的真爱才会知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.25,0:58:20.79,CHS,757,0,0,0,,知道什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.80,0:58:25.50,CHS,758,0,0,0,,哇 好可爱的猫咪 史莱克 我们能养他不
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.65,0:58:44.48,CHS,759,0,0,0,,对不起 借过一下
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.65,0:58:47.36,CHS,760,0,0,0,,不好意思 注意身后
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.53,0:58:50.40,CHS,761,0,0,0,,看 驴子 烤香肠摊 快
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.58,0:58:53.45,CHS,762,0,0,0,,闪开 跟着他 快 驴子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.62,0:58:55.74,CHS,763,0,0,0,,伙计 你真是个灾猫难
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.91,0:58:58.29,CHS,764,0,0,0,,而你真是荒驴谬
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.17,0:59:06.96,CHS,765,0,0,0,,我去前方侦察 等我的信号
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.01,0:59:13.89,CHS,766,0,0,0,,各就各位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.24,0:59:32.78,CHS,767,0,0,0,,- 这里视野真好 - 你在这干嘛?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.95,0:59:33.98,CHS,768,0,0,0,,快回去就位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.16,0:59:37.24,CHS,769,0,0,0,,你必须知道我是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.41,0:59:38.87,CHS,770,0,0,0,,你要毁了一切
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.04,0:59:41.28,CHS,771,0,0,0,,毁了一切? 事实上我是来拯救一切的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.46,0:59:44.16,CHS,772,0,0,0,,绿怪 烂皮儿 你的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.75,0:59:47.41,CHS,773,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道我的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.59,0:59:52.00,CHS,774,0,0,0,,好了好了 拜托 菲奥娜... 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.18,0:59:54.71,CHS,775,0,0,0,,我可以解释这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.23,1:00:01.01,CHS,776,0,0,0,,- 菲奥娜的信号呢 - 她在等什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.19,1:00:04.02,CHS,777,0,0,0,,- 他要跑了 - 不 他不会
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.59,1:00:33.37,CHS,778,0,0,0,,听着 我不知道你是谁 也不知道你是怎么知道我的诅咒的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.55,1:00:35.43,CHS,779,0,0,0,,但如果这些绿怪发现我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.60,1:00:38.85,CHS,780,0,0,0,,- 一个美丽的公主? - 我不是 再也不是了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.02,1:00:42.05,CHS,781,0,0,0,,- 听着 我知道你很沮丧 - 你什么也不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.23,1:00:43.89,CHS,782,0,0,0,,我什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.06,1:00:47.06,CHS,783,0,0,0,,我知道你的歌声可以让鸟儿都羞愧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:49.39,CHS,784,0,0,0,,- 这很了不起吗 - 我知道你每次签名时
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.57,1:00:52.24,CHS,785,0,0,0,,- 都会在"I"上画个爱心 - 那又如何
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.40,1:00:54.40,CHS,786,0,0,0,,我知道你看到流星时
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.57,1:00:56.56,CHS,787,0,0,0,,会交叉手指
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.74,1:01:00.52,CHS,788,0,0,0,,捂着鼻子 许下愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:03.57,CHS,789,0,0,0,,我知道你睡觉时喜欢脚露在外面
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.75,1:01:05.41,CHS,790,0,0,0,,我还知道你要点着蜡烛睡
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.58,1:01:07.58,CHS,791,0,0,0,,因为每当你闭上眼睛...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.63,1:01:11.63,CHS,792,0,0,0,,你害怕会发现自己在高塔中醒来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.34,1:01:15.46,CHS,793,0,0,0,,但最重要的是 菲奥娜...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.47,1:01:20.05,CHS,794,0,0,0,,我知道你每天变样子的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.35,1:01:24.43,CHS,795,0,0,0,,是因为你没有被我...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.85,1:01:26.97,CHS,796,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.48,1:01:30.64,CHS,797,0,0,0,,吻过
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.20,1:01:44.12,CHS,798,0,0,0,,- 你动作真快 - 这不是我要做的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.12,1:01:48.28,CHS,799,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么回事 - 爱情?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.46,1:01:51.58,CHS,800,0,0,0,,- 不 我被强迫着跳舞了 - 被爱情所强迫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.75,1:01:54.51,CHS,801,0,0,0,,不 我停不下来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.67,1:01:57.51,CHS,802,0,0,0,,拜托 停下来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.68,1:01:59.84,CHS,803,0,0,0,,我不能控制自己
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.68,1:02:06.80,CHS,804,0,0,0,,耶 甜饼热浪冲出厨房 席卷世界了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.06,1:02:11.52,CHS,805,0,0,0,,不 是这个吹笛人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.69,1:02:17.31,CHS,806,0,0,0,,我不敢相信我让这样的事发生了 而这都是因为你!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:21.90,CHS,807,0,0,0,,- 只要你让我吻你 - 什么 你疯了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.84,1:02:40.92,CHS,808,0,0,0,,我们必须做些什么阻止他们这样乱跳下去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.10,1:02:44.51,CHS,809,0,0,0,,- 我们能做什么 - 首先 你别跳了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.68,1:02:47.39,CHS,810,0,0,0,,只要有人吹起长笛 我就想摆动身体
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.56,1:02:49.18,CHS,811,0,0,0,,那就别怪我了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.74,1:03:01.57,CHS,812,0,0,0,,快 我们得让他们离开这音乐
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.91,1:03:06.99,CHS,813,0,0,0,,靴猫和驴子拯救世界!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.69,1:03:35.18,CHS,814,0,0,0,,驴子 我能不能借你舌头一用
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.36,1:03:36.44,CHS,815,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.40,1:03:38.73,CHS,816,0,0,0,,不 见鬼...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.20,1:03:44.23,CHS,817,0,0,0,,我可不管你有多大的眼睛 那对我没作用
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.00,1:03:51.08,CHS,818,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.58,1:03:52.61,CHS,819,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.79,1:03:55.25,CHS,820,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪 - 去救我的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.42,1:03:58.25,CHS,821,0,0,0,,- 怎么救 让你自己丧命吗 - 如果必须这样的话
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.42,1:03:59.70,CHS,822,0,0,0,,靴猫 说点什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.88,1:04:01.75,CHS,823,0,0,0,,- 靴猫? - 我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.93,1:04:04.05,CHS,824,0,0,0,,所以你才知道我这么多事的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.22,1:04:07.30,CHS,825,0,0,0,,- 菲奥娜 等等 吻我 - 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.47,1:04:09.10,CHS,826,0,0,0,,这是救你伙伴的唯一方法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.27,1:04:10.30,CHS,827,0,0,0,,别挡路
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.48,1:04:13.59,CHS,828,0,0,0,,你以前是相信只要一个吻可以解决一切的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.21,1:04:44.42,CHS,829,0,0,0,,我不懂 这完全不对劲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.59,1:04:47.21,CHS,830,0,0,0,,真爱之吻应该是可以挽回一切的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.39,1:04:49.46,CHS,831,0,0,0,,对 他们也是这么跟我说的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.64,1:04:51.96,CHS,832,0,0,0,,让我逃出高塔的不是真爱之吻
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.14,1:04:54.85,CHS,833,0,0,0,,是我 我救出了自己
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:04:59.47,CHS,834,0,0,0,,你不明白吗 这就是个童话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.65,1:05:02.06,CHS,835,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 别这么说 那是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.23,1:05:03.61,CHS,836,0,0,0,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.78,1:05:06.48,CHS,837,0,0,0,,你是在火龙的看守下长大的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:09.49,CHS,838,0,0,0,,你试过在悲惨的高塔里孤独地生活吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.66,1:05:11.98,CHS,839,0,0,0,,你试过每夜啜泣着入睡
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.16,1:05:14.73,CHS,840,0,0,0,,等待永远不可能到来的真爱吗?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.04,1:05:19.62,CHS,841,0,0,0,,但...但我是你的真爱啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.79,1:05:23.21,CHS,842,0,0,0,,那我需要你的时候你在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.06,1:05:37.55,CHS,843,0,0,0,,或许你亲错人了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.19,1:05:39.22,CHS,844,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.77,1:05:41.56,CHS,845,0,0,0,,那个吻没起作用
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.52,1:05:44.85,CHS,846,0,0,0,,是因为菲奥娜不爱我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.41,1:05:53.12,CHS,847,0,0,0,,不要绝望 绿怪兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.29,1:05:57.53,CHS,848,0,0,0,,他们可以用笼子锁住我们 但不能锁住我们的荣耀
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.92,1:06:01.83,CHS,849,0,0,0,,史莱克和菲奥娜在一起?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.92,1:06:07.17,CHS,850,0,0,0,,我听够你的"嘀嘀嗒嗒"了 别吹了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.34,1:06:09.00,CHS,851,0,0,0,,狼外婆 拿我的演讲假发来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.18,1:06:13.42,CHS,852,0,0,0,,芭芭 给我化妆 还有吹笛人 给我穿袜子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.89,1:06:18.51,CHS,853,0,0,0,,- 够紧 - 注意 居民们
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.31,1:06:23.60,CHS,854,0,0,0,,请注意听我们的大独裁者发表演说
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.98,1:06:28.40,CHS,855,0,0,0,,亲爱的臣民 是我 烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:30.65,CHS,856,0,0,0,,你们梦想的守护者
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.49,1:06:35.44,CHS,857,0,0,0,,最近 某人...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.62,1:06:38.95,CHS,858,0,0,0,,正在威胁我们幸福快乐的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.92,1:06:44.87,CHS,859,0,0,0,,而那个某人就是丑陋的绿怪史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:47.33,CHS,860,0,0,0,,所以我要向你们求助 亲爱的子民
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.51,1:06:50.00,CHS,861,0,0,0,,不论是谁把这个绿怪带给我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.18,1:06:54.17,CHS,862,0,0,0,,他将得到一份终身快乐合约
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.85,1:06:56.26,CHS,863,0,0,0,,想想吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.43,1:06:58.14,CHS,864,0,0,0,,- 无尽的快乐 - 耶
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.31,1:07:01.76,CHS,865,0,0,0,,所有的热情 欲望 一切愿望
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.94,1:07:03.93,CHS,866,0,0,0,,- 耶! - 最狂野的梦想
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.11,1:07:08.73,CHS,867,0,0,0,,所有你想要的一切 没有任何附加条件
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.03,1:07:12.11,CHS,868,0,0,0,,不过要快 这是有时限的哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.28,1:07:18.12,CHS,869,0,0,0,,点亮你的火把 削尖你的杈子 抄起你的拖把吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.62,1:07:21.66,CHS,870,0,0,0,,史莱克! 史莱克! 史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.92,1:07:27.96,CHS,871,0,0,0,,回你的老家去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.13,1:07:32.76,CHS,872,0,0,0,,我们似乎安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.93,1:07:35.71,CHS,873,0,0,0,,让他们折腾去吧 我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.89,1:07:39.97,CHS,874,0,0,0,,有什么意义 吻不起作用 一切都结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.14,1:07:43.14,CHS,875,0,0,0,,听着 史莱克 我知道事情有点不尽如人意
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.31,1:07:45.77,CHS,876,0,0,0,,但船到桥头自然直
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.94,1:07:48.31,CHS,877,0,0,0,,- 我打赌明天这个时候... - 你不明白吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.48,1:07:50.14,CHS,878,0,0,0,,没有明天了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.32,1:07:54.27,CHS,879,0,0,0,,没有后天 没有大后天 没有大大后天
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.45,1:07:57.95,CHS,880,0,0,0,,我的生活曾经是完美的 而我再也回不去了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.12,1:08:01.70,CHS,881,0,0,0,,如果你的生活真那么完美.那你干嘛还跟烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿签约
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.87,1:08:05.24,CHS,882,0,0,0,,因为我直到失去了才知道它有多美好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.05,1:08:11.87,CHS,883,0,0,0,,我不知道它那么美好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.47,1:08:17.97,CHS,884,0,0,0,,投降吧 我要把你带走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.55,1:08:22.09,CHS,885,0,0,0,,别想抵抗 绿怪! 奖赏是我的了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.27,1:08:23.30,CHS,886,0,0,0,,姜饼人?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.10,1:08:26.51,CHS,887,0,0,0,,- 放开我 绿魔鬼 - 你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.69,1:08:27.97,CHS,888,0,0,0,,拿酬劳!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.15,1:08:30.14,CHS,889,0,0,0,,- 酬劳? - 你在说什么 小饼干
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.90,1:08:33.35,CHS,890,0,0,0,,烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿许诺给把你抓住的人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.53,1:08:36.53,CHS,891,0,0,0,,- 一份终身快乐合约 - 终身快乐合约?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.70,1:08:39.73,CHS,892,0,0,0,,你所有的愿望都可以实现
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.41,1:08:42.74,CHS,893,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.54,1:08:46.24,CHS,894,0,0,0,,- 还有得补救 - 怎么补救
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.42,1:08:50.71,CHS,895,0,0,0,,我要给烂皮儿踩高跷皮儿他想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.88,1:08:53.20,CHS,896,0,0,0,,好了 姜饼人 告诉我...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.59,1:08:59.59,CHS,897,0,0,0,,你们不是打算吃了他的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.60,1:09:04.68,CHS,898,0,0,0,,不是史莱克 这不是史莱克 这也不是史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.85,1:09:08.14,CHS,899,0,0,0,,这连个绿怪都不是 是个巨人 亏你们想得出来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.31,1:09:09.34,CHS,900,0,0,0,,- 还有这个... - 咆哮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.52,1:09:10.55,CHS,901,0,0,0,,真是可悲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.40,1:09:13.27,CHS,902,0,0,0,,这又是个什么鬼东西
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.44,1:09:15.02,CHS,903,0,0,0,,我只是个吓坏了的老头儿
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.19,1:09:18.11,CHS,904,0,0,0,,别听他的 这些绿怪都很狡猾
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.28,1:09:19.90,CHS,905,0,0,0,,那是你涂绿了的老爸
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.07,1:09:22.11,CHS,906,0,0,0,,不 这是史莱克! 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.66,1:09:24.69,CHS,907,0,0,0,,让他们滚
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.87,1:09:27.74,CHS,908,0,0,0,,就没有人能抓到史莱克吗?! 他在哪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.91,1:09:30.62,CHS,909,0,0,0,,这有多难 我要抓住他 抓住他 抓住他
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.13,1:09:32.45,CHS,910,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.05,1:09:35.75,CHS,911,0,0,0,,我听说你在找我
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.59,1:09:38.55,CHS,912,0,0,0,,好了 总算来了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.72,1:09:42.17,CHS,913,0,0,0,,谁交出来了 谁能得到终身快乐合约
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.35,1:09:44.17,CHS,914,0,0,0,,- 我 - 什么 但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.35,1:09:48.26,CHS,915,0,0,0,,我把自己交出来了 我该得到终身快乐合约
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.27,1:09:55.02,CHS,916,0,0,0,,也就是说你要给我任何我想要的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.19,1:09:57.76,CHS,917,0,0,0,,不 只有真爱之吻可以打破你的合约
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.94,1:09:59.82,CHS,918,0,0,0,,所以你要是以为你可以...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.86,1:10:05.11,CHS,919,0,0,0,,- 就这样 夺回你的生活 - 我来不是为了要夺回我的生活
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.66,1:10:08.07,CHS,920,0,0,0,,那你想要什么
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.84,1:10:21.33,CHS,921,0,0,0,,绿怪们 他们都自由了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.51,1:10:23.00,CHS,922,0,0,0,,不过史莱克呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.18,1:10:30.51,CHS,923,0,0,0,,不太妙啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.64,1:10:35.14,CHS,924,0,0,0,,不知道 这不太像童话故事的结尾
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.31,1:10:41.15,CHS,925,0,0,0,,高尚的史莱克用自己换取了一群 肮脏绿怪的自由
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.70,1:10:44.37,CHS,926,0,0,0,,只要他们都自由
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.87,1:10:46.86,CHS,927,0,0,0,,而且菲奥娜是安全的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.37,1:10:51.32,CHS,928,0,0,0,,我确信菲奥娜会为此深深感动
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.00,1:10:53.28,CHS,929,0,0,0,,但是 嘿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.46,1:10:56.37,CHS,930,0,0,0,,我觉得你可以亲口告诉她
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.21,1:10:58.67,CHS,931,0,0,0,,菲奥娜!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.05,1:11:11.35,CHS,932,0,0,0,,踩高跷皮儿 我们达成协议了的 你同意放了所有绿怪的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.52,1:11:12.76,CHS,933,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:17.56,CHS,934,0,0,0,,但菲奥娜不算真正的绿怪 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.57,1:11:26.36,CHS,935,0,0,0,,白昼与黑夜交替更迭 之类之类的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.24,1:11:30.45,CHS,936,0,0,0,,没人比我更聪明了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.59,1:11:41.08,CHS,937,0,0,0,,你真的很勇敢 史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.84,1:11:42.87,CHS,938,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.59,1:11:45.92,CHS,939,0,0,0,,不 你说得对
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.76,1:11:48.88,CHS,940,0,0,0,,你需要我时我不在
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.05,1:11:51.38,CHS,941,0,0,0,,不仅仅是在火龙看守的高塔 还有...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.72,1:11:54.47,CHS,942,0,0,0,,之后的每一天
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.44,1:11:56.60,CHS,943,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.60,1:11:59.23,CHS,944,0,0,0,,但你现在在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.94,1:12:03.73,CHS,945,0,0,0,,放开我 我要去救史莱克
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:05.28,CHS,946,0,0,0,,别傻了 驴子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.45,1:12:07.94,CHS,947,0,0,0,,她说得对 烂皮儿的宫殿守卫森严
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.12,1:12:11.40,CHS,948,0,0,0,,- 比老外婆的抽屉还严实 - 至少抽屉没有
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.58,1:12:14.58,CHS,949,0,0,0,,一群刻薄丑陋的女巫守卫着
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.75,1:12:17.62,CHS,950,0,0,0,,嘿 我们听得见的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.46,1:12:19.95,CHS,951,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.42,1:12:23.25,CHS,952,0,0,0,,我们必须进入宫殿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.42,1:12:25.54,CHS,953,0,0,0,,史莱克和我倒从里面出来过
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.72,1:12:27.26,CHS,954,0,0,0,,但怎么进去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.47,1:12:31.42,CHS,955,0,0,0,,怎么出来就怎么进去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.89,1:12:40.02,CHS,956,0,0,0,,耶! 我的新球球 是不是比购物目录上的看起来还大些
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.19,1:12:41.77,CHS,957,0,0,0,,看起来很不错
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.24,1:12:51.95,CHS,958,0,0,0,,女巫们 我们期待已久的时刻终于到来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.12,1:12:54.90,CHS,959,0,0,0,,今晚隆重的盛事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.08,1:12:58.24,CHS,960,0,0,0,,有请史莱克和菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.34,1:13:07.38,CHS,961,0,0,0,,现在就让往事随风
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.55,1:13:11.30,CHS,962,0,0,0,,让我重新展示一场英雄救美的童话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.47,1:13:15.05,CHS,963,0,0,0,,菲奥娜的噩梦 守卫者...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.22,1:13:16.80,CHS,964,0,0,0,,火龙!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.79,1:13:42.08,CHS,965,0,0,0,,- 驴子? - 和...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.88,1:13:46.99,CHS,966,0,0,0,,穿靴子的猫!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.12,1:14:19.16,CHS,967,0,0,0,,抓住他们 抓住他们 女巫们!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.00,1:14:22.54,CHS,968,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:29.12,CHS,969,0,0,0,,- 驴子 求爱 - 向谁求爱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.30,1:14:30.67,CHS,970,0,0,0,,你老婆
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.74,1:14:55.85,CHS,971,0,0,0,,啊哦
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.37,1:15:04.66,CHS,972,0,0,0,,我会打给你的 我们相爱了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.43,1:15:17.88,CHS,973,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 抓住了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.60,1:15:21.22,CHS,974,0,0,0,,嘿 你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.75,1:15:53.84,CHS,975,0,0,0,,- 烤香肠?! - 趁热吃!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.76,1:16:01.96,CHS,976,0,0,0,,跳
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.43,1:16:06.63,CHS,977,0,0,0,,现在!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.70,1:16:23.32,CHS,978,0,0,0,,穿过桥下
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.45,1:16:25.95,CHS,979,0,0,0,,绕过火龙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.12,1:16:27.20,CHS,980,0,0,0,,最终...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:28.95,CHS,981,0,0,0,,抵达城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:37.01,CHS,982,0,0,0,,跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.14,1:16:44.47,CHS,983,0,0,0,,飞
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.31,1:16:47.64,CHS,984,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.52,1:16:51.63,CHS,985,0,0,0,,走 飞飞 走!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.81,1:16:53.69,CHS,986,0,0,0,,女巫们 把门关上
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.82,1:16:57.44,CHS,987,0,0,0,,飞啊 飞飞 快 扇翅膀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.61,1:17:00.98,CHS,988,0,0,0,,快 走 飞 飞啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.82,1:17:03.15,CHS,989,0,0,0,,飞飞 不
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.91,1:17:09.82,CHS,990,0,0,0,,胜利是属于我们的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.21,1:17:21.21,CHS,991,0,0,0,,似乎明天早餐又有新花样了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.38,1:17:23.96,CHS,992,0,0,0,,我们真是好搭档
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:26.09,CHS,993,0,0,0,,没想到吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.02,1:17:35.35,CHS,994,0,0,0,,史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.15,1:17:41.02,CHS,995,0,0,0,,他的末日到了 他要完了...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.61,1:17:42.77,CHS,996,0,0,0,,史莱克?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.86,1:17:45.52,CHS,997,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.08,1:17:51.37,CHS,998,0,0,0,,一定有什么我可以做的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.21,1:17:55.82,CHS,999,0,0,0,,你已经为我做了所有了 菲奥娜
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.00,1:17:58.57,CHS,1000,0,0,0,,你给了我家和家人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.75,1:18:00.50,CHS,1001,0,0,0,,你有孩子?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.67,1:18:02.66,CHS,1002,0,0,0,,我们有孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.84,1:18:06.71,CHS,1003,0,0,0,,费格斯 法科尔 还有个小女儿叫...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.89,1:18:08.22,CHS,1004,0,0,0,,- 费利西亚 - 费利西亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.10,1:18:11.88,CHS,1005,0,0,0,,我一直想生个女儿 取名费利西亚
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.43,1:18:14.09,CHS,1006,0,0,0,,总有一天...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.77,1:18:17.10,CHS,1007,0,0,0,,你会有的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.78,1:18:30.45,CHS,1008,0,0,0,,你知道今天最美好的部分是什么吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.08,1:18:37.24,CHS,1009,0,0,0,,我又重新爱上了你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.16,1:19:13.99,CHS,1010,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 太阳升起了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.16,1:19:16.45,CHS,1011,0,0,0,,你还是个...绿怪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.96,1:19:21.91,CHS,1012,0,0,0,,- 真爱之魂 - 不可能
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.67,1:19:24.33,CHS,1013,0,0,0,,吻生效了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.01,1:19:32.34,CHS,1014,0,0,0,,什么?!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.77,1:19:43.18,CHS,1015,0,0,0,,飞飞
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.98,1:19:46.31,CHS,1016,0,0,0,,靴猫!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.65,1:19:50.40,CHS,1017,0,0,0,,不 不 不
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.57,1:19:53.66,CHS,1018,0,0,0,,不 我还没准备好呢 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.80,1:20:09.26,CHS,1019,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.43,1:20:12.68,CHS,1020,0,0,0,,史莱克! 史莱克! 史莱克! 史莱克!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.10,1:20:20.30,CHS,1021,0,0,0,,大家注意 我又找到了个蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.06,1:20:23.35,CHS,1022,0,0,0,,史莱克? 你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.86,1:20:34.03,CHS,1023,0,0,0,,菲奥娜 我从没感觉这么好过
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.20,1:20:37.86,CHS,1024,0,0,0,,咆哮!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.71,1:20:45.03,CHS,1025,0,0,0,,生日快乐 法科尔
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.21,1:20:47.50,CHS,1026,0,0,0,,费格斯 我的小家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.67,1:20:49.96,CHS,1027,0,0,0,,还有费利西亚 小甜心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.13,1:20:52.37,CHS,1028,0,0,0,,我想这是你的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.76,1:20:55.42,CHS,1029,0,0,0,,谢谢 爹地
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.93,1:20:59.42,CHS,1030,0,0,0,,嘿 史莱克叔叔 给我的宝宝们再来一遍
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.60,1:21:01.72,CHS,1031,0,0,0,,求你了先生 再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.03,1:21:16.48,CHS,1032,0,0,0,,- 我从不知道我们还有这一招 - 真是我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.74,1:21:19.90,CHS,1033,0,0,0,,我一直以为是我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.08,1:21:22.45,CHS,1034,0,0,0,,把你从火龙看守的高塔中救出来的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.62,1:21:24.00,CHS,1035,0,0,0,,确实是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.17,1:21:27.75,CHS,1036,0,0,0,,不 是你救了我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.60,1:21:43.01,CHS,1037,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.84,1:23:00.17,CHS,1038,0,0,0,,好吃的!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.38,1:29:18.37,CHS,1039,0,0,0,,
